  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubutumwa Bwiza uko bwanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Intangamarara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Abantu benshi baragerageje kwandika inkuru z’ivyabereye hagati muri twebwe, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />nk’uko twazishikirijwe n’abavyiboneye kuva bigitangura, ari na bo bamamaje Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ni co gituma nanje, maze gutohoza neza uko vyagenze vyose kuva mu ntango, nahisemwo kukwandikira inkuru y’ukuri kandi itomoye, nyakwubahwa Teyofilo, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />kugira ngo umenye udakekeranya ko inyigisho wakiriye ari iz’ukuri.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuvuka kwa Yohana Umubatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Igihe Herode yari umwami w’i Yudaya, hari umuherezi yitwa Zakariya wo mu mugwi w’abaherezi bitirirwa Abiya. Umugore wiwe yitwa Elizabeti, na we akaba yakomoka mu muryango wa Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Zakariya na Elizabeti bari abagororotsi imbere y’Imana, kandi bakurikiza ivyagezwe n’amabwirizwa vy’Umwami Imana ata co bahajije. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ariko nta mwana bari bafise, kuko Elizabeti atavyara, kandi bompi bari bashaje cane.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Umusi umwe, Zakariya yariko arakora igikorwa ciwe c’ubuherezi mu Ngoro y’Imana, kuko umugwi wiwe ari wo wari uramukiwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Yari yatowe hakoreshejwe ubupfindo nk’uko umugenzo w’ubuherezi wabitegekanya mu guhitamwo uwinjira mu rusengero rw’Umwami Imana guturira ibimota neza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imibavu</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Igihe co guturira ivyo bimota neza kigeze, abari ngaho bose bariko basengera hanze.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Maze umumarayika w’Umwami Imana yiyereka Zakariya, ahagaze i buryo bw’igicaniro baturirirako ibimota neza. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya amubonye afatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ariko wa mumarayika aramubarira ati: “Zakariya we, ntutinye, kuko Imana yumvise ugusenga kwawe. Umugore wawe Elizabeti agiye kukuvyarira umwana w’umuhungu, na we uze umwite Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Uwo mwana azogutera kunezerwa no guhimbarwa, kandi ivuka ryiwe rizonezereza benshi, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />kuko azoba uwuhambaye imbere y’Umwami Imana. Ntazokoza umuvinyu ku munwa canke ikindi kintu cose kiboreza, kandi azoba yuzuye Mpwemu Yera kuva akiri mu nda ya nyina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Azogarukana Abisirayeli benshi k’Uhoraho, Imana yabo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Azogendera imbere y’Umwami Imana afise impwemu n’ububasha nk’ivya Eliya, kugira ngo agarukane imitima y’abavyeyi ku bana babo, abatumvira Imana na bo abagarukane ku bwenge bw’abagororotsi; uko ni ko azotegurira abantu kwakira Umwami Imana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya abaza uwo mumarayika ati: “Ivyo novyemezwa n’iki, ko nshaje kandi umugore wanje akaba ageze mu zabukuru?”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Wa mumarayika aramwishura ati: “Ndi Gaburiyeli, kandi nama mpagaze imbere y’Imana. Ni yo yandungitse kukubwira iyi nkuru nziza. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kuva ubu, ugiye kuba ikiragi, ntuzosubira kuvuga kugeza uwo mwana avutse, kuko utizeye ivyo ndakubwiye. Kandi bizoshika igihe cavyo kigeze.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mu gihe ivyo vyariko biraba, abantu bari hanze, bagumye barindiriye Zakariya bibaza igituma yatevye akamara mu rusengero umwanya munini. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ariko asohotse, ntiyashobora kuvugana na bo. Abantu baca batahura ko hari ivyo yerekewe mu rusengero, kuko yabavugisha akoresheje ibimenyetso vy’amaboko, ntavuge.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ikiringo c’ibikorwa vyiwe vy’ubuherezi kirangiye, asubira i muhira. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Haheze imisi, umugore wiwe Elizabeti asama inda, aca amara amezi atanu ataja ahabona. Avuga ati: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Ehe ivyiza Umwami Imana yankoreye! Muri iki gihe, yangiriye ubuntu ankurako ibiteterwe mu bantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya abwirwa ko azovyara Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elizabeti amaze amezi atandatu yibungenze, Imana irungika umumarayika Gaburiyeli mu gisagara c’i Galilaya citwa Nazareti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ku nkumi yitwa Mariya yari ikowe n’umusore yitwa Yosefu, wo mu muryango wa Dawidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Uwo mumarayika yinjira aho Mariya ari, amubwira ati: “Nezerwa! Umwami Imana akugiriye ubuntu, kandi ari kumwe na we.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya aterwa ubwoba bwinshi n’ayo majambo, yibaza ico iyo ndamukanyo isigura. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ariko wa mumarayika aramuhumuriza ati: “Ntutinye, Mariya, kuko ugiriwe ubuntu n’Imana. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Raba ugiye gusama inda, maze uzovyara umwana w’umuhungu, kandi uze umwite Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Azoba uwuhambaye, kandi azokwitwa Umwana w’Iyisumbavyose. Umwami Imana azomuha intebe y’inganji ya sekuruza Dawidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />kandi azoganza inzu ya Yakobo ibihe bidashira; Ubwami bwiwe ntibuzogira iherezo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya abaza uwo mumarayika ati: “Ivyo vyoshoboka bite, ko ntarigera ndyamana n’umugabo?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Mpwemu Yera azokuzako, maze ubushobozi bw’Iyisumbavyose bugutwikire. Ni co gituma umwana uzovyara azoba uwera, yitwe Umwana w’Imana. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Mbere na Elizabeti incuti yawe agiye kuvyara umwana mu myaka yiwe y’ubusaza. Uwahora yitwa ingumba, uku ni ukwezi kugira gatandatu yibungenze, <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />kuko ata jambo Imana ivuze ribura ububasha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya aramwishura ati: “Jewe ndi umusavyikazi w’Umwami Imana, nibimbere nk’uko ubivuze.” Maze uwo mumarayika aca amusiga aho aragenda.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya aja kuramutsa Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Muri iyo misi, Mariya aritegura, aduga yihuta aja mu misozi y’i Yudaya, mu gisagara, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Zakariya yabamwo. Ashitse, aramutsa umugore wiwe Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Na we yumvise indamukanyo ya Mariya, umwana yari mu nda yiwe ariginagura. Elizabeti aca yuzuzwa Mpwemu Yera, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Urahezagiwe mu bandi bagore bose, n’umwana ari mu nda yawe arahezagiwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mbega nari iki kugira ngo nyina w’Umwami wanje angendere? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nabaye ncumva indamukanyo yawe, umwana ari mu nda aca ariginagura kubera umunezero. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Urahiriwe kuko wizeye ko ivyo Umwami Imana yavuze bizoshika.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya ahimbaza Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariya aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Umutima wanje urahimbaza Umwami Imana,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />kandi impwemu yanje inezererewe Imana yo Mukiza wanje,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kuko yibutse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">umusavyikazi wayo muto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Uhereye ubu abantu bose bazonyita umuhirwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kuko Inyenkomezi yankoreye ibihambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">izina ryayo ni iryera.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Igirira imbabazi abayubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">uko uruganwe rukurikirana n’urundi.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ukuboko kwayo kwakoze ivy’inkomezi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">yashwiragije abishira hejuru mu mitima yabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Yakuye abatware ku ntebe z’inganji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ishira hejuru abaciye bugufi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Yahagije ivyiza abashonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">yirukana abatunzi bagenda imbokoboko.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Yatabaye umusavyi wayo Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">yibuka kugirira imbabazi<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Aburahamu n’uruvyaro rwiwe ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">nk’uko yari yarabisezeraniye ba sogokuruza.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Nuko Mariya amarana na Elizabeti amezi nk’atatu, araheza arataha.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivuka rya Yohana Umubatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Igihe ciwe co kwibaruka kigeze, Elizabeti yibaruka umwana w’umuhungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Incuti n’ababanyi bumvise ko Umwami Imana yamugiriye ubuntu, banezeranwa na we.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Umwana amaze imisi umunani, bamujana kumukeba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nk’uko vyategekwa n’Ivyagezwe vya Mose.</char></note>. Bagira bamwite izina rya se Zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />nyina arahakana, avuga ati: “Oya, izina ryiwe ni Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Na bo baramubwira bati: “None ko ata n’umwe wo mu muryango wanyu yitwa iryo zina!”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Baca babaza se bakoresheje ibimenyetso ngo ababwire izina ashaka ko bita umwana wiwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya aca asaba ico kwandikako, yandika ati: “Izina ryiwe ni Yohana.” Bose baratangara. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ubwo nyene akanwa kiwe gaca karuguruka, ururimi ruragoboroka, aca atangura kuvuga ahimbaza Imana. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Abari aho bose bafatwa n’ubwoba, kandi iyo nkuru yamamara mu misozi yose y’i Yudaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Abavyumva bose vyabatera kwibaza mu mitima bati: “None uwo mwana azoba umuntu ki?” Kuko vyaraboneka ko ubushobozi bw’Umwami Imana bwari kuri we.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuvugishwa kwa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Se Zakariya, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, atangura kuvugishwa ati:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Amashimwe ni ay’Umwami, Imana ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">kuko yaje gutabara no gucungura abantu bayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Iduhagurukirije Umukiza ahambaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mu nzu ya Dawidi, umusavyi wayo<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />nk’uko yabisezeranye kera ikoresheje abavugishwa bayo bera,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />izodukiza abansi bacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">iturokore no mu maboko y’abatwanka.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Yagiriye imbabazi ba sogokuruza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">yibuka isezerano ryayo ryera,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />ari yo ndahiro yarahiye sogokuruza Aburahamu;<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ko izodukiza agahahazo k’abansi bacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">ikadushoboza kuyikorera ata bwoba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />mu kwera no mu kuyigororokera imisi yose yo kubaho kwacu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Kandi nawe, mwana wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">uzokwitwa uwuvugishwa n’Iyisumbavyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kuko uzokwitangira imbere Umwami Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ukamutegurira inzira.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Uzokwigisha abantu biwe inzira y’agakiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">kava mu guharirwa ivyaha vyabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kubw’imbabazi nyinshi z’Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">umuco w’igitondo ugiye kuturasira uvuye mw’ijuru,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />kugira ngo uboneshereze abari mu mwijima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">n’abari mu gitutu c’urupfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">wongere urongorere intambuko zacu mu nzira y’amahoro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Uwo mwana arakura, arakomera mu mpwemu, aba mu bugaragwa gushika igihe yiyerekeye Abisirayeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ivuka rya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Muri iyo misi, Kayisari Ogusito, umwami w’abami w’Abaroma, asohora itegeko ko haba urusansuma rw’abantu bose baba mu bwami bw’Abaroma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Urwo rwari urusansuma rwa mbere rubaye kandi ico gihe Kiriniyusi yatwara intara ya Siriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Nuko abantu bose baja mu bisagara bavukiyemwo kwisansumisha.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefu na we nyene ava i Nazareti, igisagara c’i Galilaya, aduga i Yudaya mu gisagara ca Dawidi citwa Betelehemu, kuko yakomoka mu muryango wa Dawidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Nuko aja kwisansumisha ajanye na Mariya, uwo yari akoye, kandi Mariya yari yibungenze. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Bakiri i Betelehemu, igihe co kwibaruka kiragera, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />maze avyara umwana wiwe w’imfura, amuzingira mu mpuzu z’uruyoya, aca amuryamika mu bwato inka ziriramwo, kuko bari babuze ikibanza mu nzu y’ingenzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Muri ako karere hari abungere bama barara mu gahinga baraririye imikuku y’ibitungwa vyabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Umumarayika w’Umwami Imana arabiyereka, ubwiza bw’Umwami Imana bubakayanganira impande zose, na bo baterwa n’ubwoba bwinshi cane. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Uwo mumarayika aca ababwira ati: “Ntimutinye kuko ndabazaniye inkuru nziza y’umunezero mwinshi ku bantu bose. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Uwu musi, umukiza yabavukiye mu gisagara ca Dawidi, ni we Kristo, Umwami. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Iki ni co kizobabera ikimenyetso: muzosanga uruyoya ruzingiriweko impuzu, ruryamitswe mu bwato inka ziriramwo.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ubwo nyene haca haboneka ingabo nyinshi cane zo mw’ijuru zifatanya n’uwo mumarayika, zihimbaza Imana ziti:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Icubahiro kibe ic’Imana mw’ijuru riri hejuru y’ayandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">kw’isi na ho amahoro abe mu bantu bayihimbara.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Abo bamarayika bamaze gusubira mw’ijuru, ba bungere baca baravugana bati: “Nimuze tugende i Betelehemu kuraba ivyabaye, ivyo Umwami Imana atubwiye.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Baca bagenda bihuta, basangaho Mariya na Yosefu, n’umwana aryamye mu bwato inka ziriramwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Bamubonye baca babwira bose ivyo babwiwe kuri uwo mwana, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />kandi abavyumva bose vyarabatangaza cane. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ariko Mariya we, yaguma azigama ayo majambo yose mu mutima wiwe, akayiyumvirako cane. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ba bungere na bo basubira inyuma bahimbaza Imana bongera bayitazira kubera ivyo bumvise n’ivyo babonye, kuko basanze bimeze nk’uko bari babibwiwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bajana Yesu mu rusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ku musi ugira umunani, bahejeje gukeba uwo mwana, bamwita Yesu, nk’uko umumarayika yari yarabwiye Mariya imbere y’uko asama inda yiwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Igihe c’imigenzo yo guhumanurwa kigeze, nk’uko Ivyagezwe vya Mose vyabitegekanya, Yosefu na Mariya badugana Yesu i Yerusalemu kumushikanira Umwami Imana. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vy’Uhoraho, “Umuhungu wese w’imfura yategerezwa kwegurirwa Uhoraho”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kuvayo 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Nuko Yosefu na Mariya baca batanga ikimazi nk’uko ivyo Vyagezwe vy’Uhoraho vyabitegekanya: “inyoni zitwa intunguru zibiri canke inuma zikiri nto zibiri.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Abalewi 12:8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />I Yerusalemu hari umugabo yitwa Simeyoni, yari umugororotsi kandi yubaha Imana. Yari yiteze kubona ukwirurwa kwa Isirayeli, kandi Mpwemu Yera yari kuri we. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Kandi yari yarahishuriwe na Mpwemu Yera ko atazopfa atabonye Kristo yasezeranywe n’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Arongowe na Mpwemu Yera, yinjira mu rusengero. Yosefu na Mariya bazanye Yesu mu rusengero kugira ngo bashitse ivyo ivyagezwe vyategekanya kuri we, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeyoni aramwakira, amukikira mu maboko yiwe, ashima Imana ati:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Ubu rero, Mwami Imana, nk’uko wansezeraniye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">urasezeye umusavyi wawe amahoro.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kuko amaso yanje yiboneye agakiza,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ako wateguriye amahanga yose.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ni umuco uzohishurira Abanyamahanga Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ni icubahiro ku bwoko bwawe bwa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Abavyeyi b’uwo mwana batangazwa cane n’ayo majambo amuvuzeko. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nuko Simeyoni arabahezagira, maze abarira Mariya ati: “Uwu mwana ashizweho kugira ngo, muri Isirayeli, abantu benshi bagwe, abandi bavyuke. Azoba ikimenyetso kivuye ku Mana, ariko benshi bazomugwanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Ivyo bizotuma ivyiyumviro vyo mu mitima ya benshi bija ahabona. Kandi na wewe nyene, inkota izogusogota mu mutima.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Hariho n’uwavugishwa n’Imana yitwa Hana, mwene Fanuweli, wo mu muryango wa Asheri, yari ashaje cane. Yabanye n’umugabo wiwe imyaka indwi gusa, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />akaba yari amaze imyaka mirongo umunani n’ine ari umupfakazi. Yama mu rusengero ijoro n’umurango, akorera Imana, asenga kandi yisonzesha. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ako kanya nyene, ashika aho bari aca atangura gushima Imana no kubwira abari biteze ugucungurwa kwa Yerusalemu bose inkuru z’uwo mwana.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yosefu na Mariya bahejeje gukora ibitegekanijwe n’Ivyagezwe vy’Uhoraho, baca basubira i Galilaya mu gisagara cabo ca Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Uwo mwana arakura, arakomera, agwiza ubwenge, kandi ubuntu bw’Imana bwari kuri we.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu rusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Uko umwaka utashe, abavyeyi ba Yesu bama baja i Yerusalemu mu misi mikuru ya Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu amaze imyaka cumi n’ibiri, ajana na bo muri iyo misi mikuru nk’uko vyari bisanzwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Imisi mikuru irangiye, abavyeyi biwe barataha, ariko uwo mwana Yesu asigara i Yerusalemu, yamara abavyeyi biwe ntibabimenya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Nuko bamara umusi wose bagenda, bibaza ko umwana yoba ari mu bandi bari bafatanije urugendo. Mu nyuma batangura kumuronderera mu ncuti n’abagenzi. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Bamubuze, basubira i Yerusalemu kumurondererayo. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Haheze imisi itatu, bamusanga mu rusengero yicaranye n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe, abumviriza yongera ababaza ibibazo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Abamwumva bose baratangazwa n’ubwenge bwiwe hamwe n’inyishu ziwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Abavyeyi biwe bamubonye baratangara cane. Nyina aramubaza ati: “Mwana wanje, ibi watugiriye ni ibiki? Twe na so tumaze imisi duhagaritse imitima cane tukurondera.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu aramubaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mwandonderera iki? Ntimwari muzi ko ntegerezwa kuba mu nzu kwa Data?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ariko ntibatahura ico ababwiye.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Maze baca basubirana na we i Nazareti, kandi yama abumvira. Nuko nyina abika ivyo vyose mu mutima wiwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu abandanya akura mu gihagararo, agwiza ubwenge, kandi agira ikiganza ciza ku Mana no ku bantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana Umubatizi ategurira Yesu inzira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mwaka ugira cumi na gatanu Kayisari Tiberiyo ari ku ngoma i Roma, Pontiyo Pilato na we ari icariho ciwe i Yudaya, Herode Antipa akaba umuganwa atwara intara ya Galilaya, uwo bavukana yitwa Filipo na we agatwara intara za Ituraya na Tirakoniti, hanyuma uwundi yitwa Lusaniya na we agatwara intara ya Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi na Kayafa na bo bakaba ari abaherezi bakuru. Ico gihe ni ho ijambo ry’Imana ryaza kuri Yohana mwene Zakariya ari mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Nuko Yohana aja mu turere twose two hakurya no hakuno y’uruzi Yorodani, yigisha abantu umubatizo wo kwihana kugira ngo baharirwe ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ivyo vyari vyaranditswe mu gitabu c’amajambo y’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya, aho yavuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Hari ijwi ry’uwusemerera mu bugaragwa ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Nimutegurire Uhoraho aho aca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">mugorore inzira agenderamwo!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Imyonga yose izokwuzuzwa iringanire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">imisozi n’udutumba vyose bizosenwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Amabarabara atagororotse azogororwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">n’inzira zisivye zizosiburwa, ziringanizwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kandi abantu bose bazobona agakiza k’Imana.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Yesaya 40:3-5</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Maze abantu benshi baja iyo Yohana ari ngo ababatize. Arababaza ati: “Mwa bana b’inzoka mwe, ni nde yababuriye ngo muhunge uburake bw’Imana bugiye kuza? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Nimukore ibikorwa vyerekana ko mwihanye, mureke kwibwira mu mitima yanyu muti: ‘Turi uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu.’ Kuko ndababwira ko, no muri aya mabuye mubona, Imana ishobora gukuramwo abana ba Aburahamu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Mbere incabiti ibanguriwe kw’imerero ry’ibiti: igiti cose kitama ivyamwa vyiza kigiye gucibwa gitererwe mu muriro.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Abantu benshi bari ngaho baramubaza bati: “None dukore iki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana arabishura ati: “Uwufise imyambaro ibiri y’impuzu, nahe umwambaro umwe uwudafise n’umwe, n’uwufise ivyokurya nagire gutyo nyene.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abatozakori na bo baraza ngo ababatize. Baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, dukore iki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Arabishura ati: “Ntimugatoze ibirengeye ivyemewe n’amategeko.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Abasoda na bo nyene baramubaza bati: “Tweho dukore iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Arabishura ati: “Ntihakagire abo munyaga utwabo kandi ntihakagire uwo mudendereza. Mubumbwe n’impembo zanyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kubera abantu bari biteze cane ukuza kwa Kristo, bagumye bibaza mu mitima ku vyerekeye Yohana ko yoba ari we Kristo. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Nuko Yohana abwira bose ati: “Jewe ndababatiza mu mazi. Ariko hagiye kuza uwundusha ubushobozi; ntibimbereye no gupfundurura utugozi tw’ibirato vyiwe. We azobabatiza muri Mpwemu Yera no mu muriro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Afise urutaro rwo kugosora mu minwe. Azokubura ikibanza co gusekuriramwo, ahejeje kugosora, azokwegeraniriza ingano mu kigega, umuguruka na wo awuturirire mu muriro utazokwigera uzima.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Nuko Yohana abandanya abwira abantu Ubutumwa Bwiza burimwo amajambo menshi yo kubatera intege.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ariko Yohana amaze kwagiriza ku mugaragaro Herode Antipa icaha co kurongora Herodiya, kandi yari asanzwe ari umugore w’uwo bavukana, akavuga n’ibindi bibi vyinshi yakoze, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Herode yaciye yongerako ikindi caha co gushira Yohana mw’ibohero.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abatizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Mu gihe abantu bose bariko barabatizwa, Yesu na we yabatijwe hamwe na bo. Ariko arasenga, ijuru riruguruka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mpwemu Yera amanuka kuri we mw’ishusho y’inuma. Maze ijwi ryumvikana rivuye mw’ijuru riti: “Uri umwana wanje nkunda akampimbara.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Igihe Yesu yatangura igikorwa ciwe yari amaze hafi imyaka mirongo itatu. Abantu benshi bibaza ko Yesu ari mwene Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:23" />
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yosefu mwene Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli mwene Matati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Matati mwene Lewi, Lewi mwene Meliki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Meliki mwene Yanayi, Yanayi mwene Yosefu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu mwene Matatiya, Matatiya mwene Amosi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amosi mwene Nahumu, Nahumu mwene Esili,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esili mwene Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagayi mwene Mayati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Mayati mwene Matatiya, Matatiya mwene Semeyini,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeyini mwene Yoseki, Yoseki mwene Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda mwene Yohanani, Yohanani mwene Resa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa mwene Zerubabeli, Zerubabeli mwene Shalutiyeli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Shalutiyeli mwene Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri mwene Meliki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Meliki mwene Hadi, Hadi mwene Kosamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosamu mwene Elumadamu, Elumadamu mwene Eri,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri mwene Yosuwa, Yosuwa mwene Eliyazeri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyazeri mwene Yorimu, Yorimu mwene Matati,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matati mwene Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi mwene Simeyoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeyoni mwene Yuda, Yuda mwene Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yosefu mwene Yonamu, Yonamu mwene Eliyakimu,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakimu mwene Meleya, Meleya mwene Mena,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mena mwene Matata, Matata mwene Natani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natani mwene Dawidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawidi mwene Isayi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Isayi mwene Obedi, Obedi mwene Bowazi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Bowazi mwene Salumoni, Salumoni mwene Nahashoni,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nahashoni mwene Aminadabu, Aminadabu mwene Ramu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Ramu mwene Hezironi, Hezironi mwene Peresi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Peresi mwene Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda mwene Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakobo mwene Isaka, Isaka mwene Aburahamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Aburahamu mwene Tera, Tera mwene Nahori,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahori mwene Serugi, Serugi mwene Reyu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reyu mwene Pelegi, Pelegi mwene Eberi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eberi mwene Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela mwene Kayinani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kayinani mwene Arupakisadi, Arupakisadi mwene Shemu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shemu mwene Nowa, Nowa mwene Lameki,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki mwene Metusela, Metusela mwene Enoki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enoki mwene Yeredi, Yeredi mwene Mahalaleli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalaleli mwene Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenani mwene Enoshi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enoshi mwene Seti, Seti mwene Adamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adamu akomoka ku Mana.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ageragezwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Hanyuma Yesu, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, ava ku ruzi Yorodani ajanwa na Mpwemu mu bugaragwa, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />ahamara imisi mirongo ine ageragezwa na Satani. Amara iyo misi ata co arya, maze iheze, yumva arashonje.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Satani aramubwira ati: “Niwaba uri Umwana w’Imana, bwira iri buye rihinduke umukate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Handitswe ngo: ‘Umuntu ntabeshwaho n’ivyokurya gusa.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Gusubiramwo 8:3</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Hanyuma Satani amujana ahantu harehare, amwereka ubwami bwose bwo mw’isi mu kanya gato. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Aramubwira ati: “Ndaguha kuganza ubwo bwami, nguhe n’ubwiza bwabwo bwose, kuko narabuhawe kandi nshobora kubuha uwo nshatse wese. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Niwapfukama ukansenga, ivyo vyose biraba ivyawe.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Handitswe ngo: ‘Usenge Uhoraho Imana yawe, kandi abe ari yo yonyene ukorera!’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Gusubiramwo 6:13</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nuko wa mubi amujana i Yerusalemu, amuhagarika ku rusengero ahantu hataramutse, amubwira ati: “Niwaba uri Umwana w’Imana, niwikororere hasi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kuko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Azotegeka abamarayika biwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">bakuzigame.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Bazokurerura mu maboko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">kugira ngo ntutsitare kw’ibuye.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Zaburi 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Handitswe ngo: ‘Ntukagerageze Uhoraho Imana yawe.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Gusubiramwo 6:16</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Satani ahejeje kumugerageza mu buryo bwose, aca amusiga aho, ntiyasubira kumugerageza gushika habonetse akandi karyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab’i Nazareti banka ivya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu aca asubira i Galilaya yuzuye ubushobozi bwa Mpwemu Yera, maze inkuru yiwe ikwira akarere kose kahegereye. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yama yigisha mu masinagogi yaho kandi agashimwa n’abantu bose.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Hanyuma Yesu aja i Nazareti aho yakuriye. Ku musi w’Isabato, yinjira mw’isinagogi nk’uko yari amenyereye, maze ahaguruka ngo asome Ivyanditswe. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Bamuhereza umuzingo w’igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya, arakizingurura, aca ashikira ahanditswe ngo:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Mpwemu w’Uhoraho ari kuri jewe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">kuko yansize amavuta</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ngo mbwire aboro Ubutumwa Bwiza.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Yantumye kubwira imbohe ko zibohotse,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">abahumye ngo bahumuke,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">kurekura abacinyijwe ngo bidegemvye,</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="wj">no kumenyekanisha umwaka wo kugirirwa ubuntu n’Uhoraho.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Yesaya 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref></char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ahejeje gusoma, aca azinga uwo muzingo w’igitabu, awusubiza uwujejwe ububiko, aca aricara. Abari mw’isinagogi bose bamuhanga amaso cane, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />na we aca atangura kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwu musi ibi Vyanditswe mwumvise birashitse.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bose baramushima, batangazwa n’amajambo y’ubuntu ava mu kanwa kiwe, babazanya bati: “Mbega uwu si wa muhungu wa Yosefu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndazi ko mutazobura kuncira uwu mugani muti: ‘Muvuzi, niwivure!’ Kandi muzombwira muti: ‘Korera muri iki gisagara uvukamwo ibitangaza nk’ivyo twumvise wakoreye i Kaperinawumu!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Arabandanya ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, nta wuvugishwa n’Imana yemerwa iwabo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><char style="wj">Mu vy’ukuri, mu gihe ca Eliya hari abapfakazi benshi muri Isirayeli, aho ijuru ryugarwa imvura ikamara imyaka itatu n’igice itagwa, amapfa agatera mu gihugu cose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><char style="wj">Ariko Eliya ntiyarungitswe ku mupfakazi n’umwe muri bo, atari ku mupfakazi w’i Zerafati mu ntara ya Sidoni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><char style="wj">Kandi hari abanyamibembe benshi muri Isirayeli mu gihe c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Elisa, ariko nta n’umwe yahumanutse imibembe atari Namani Umusiriya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Abari mw’isinagogi bavyumvise, bose barashavura cane. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Barahaguruka, bamukwegera inyuma y’igisagara, bamujana hejuru ku musozi ico gisagara cari cubatsweko, kugira ngo bamutembagarize mu manga. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ariko abaca hagati arigira.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yirukana impwemu ihumanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Nuko Yesu aca aja i Kaperinawumu mu gisagara c’i Galilaya. Ku musi w’Isabato aja kwigisha mw’isinagogi, <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />maze abantu batangazwa n’inyigisho ziwe, kuko zarimwo ububasha.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Muri iyo sinagogi hari umuntu arimwo impwemu ihumanye. Maze akoma induru n’ijwi rirenga ati: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Yesu w’i Nazareti, udushakako iki? Uzanywe no kuduhonya? Ndazi uwo uri we. Uri Uwera w’Imana!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu arayizibiza ati: <char style="wj">“Hora! Muvemwo!”</char> Uwo mudayimoni aca amukubita hasi imbere y’abantu bari ngaho, amuvamwo ata co amugize.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Abantu bose baratangara cane, barabwirana bati: “Ijambo ry’uwu muntu rirakomeye! Rifise ububasha n’inkomezi, kuko n’impwemu mbi na zo arazitegeka zikamwumvira, zigasohoka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Nuko inkuru ziwe zikwira muri ako karere kose.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu aca ava muri iyo sinagogi aja i muhira kwa Simoni. Inabukwe wa Simoni yari agwaye kandi ashushe cane, maze abari ngaho binginga Yesu ngo amukize. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu aramwegera, ahagarara i ruhande yiwe, akankamira ubwo bushuhe, buca burahera. Ako kanya nyene aca arahaguruka, arabazimana.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Izuba ririko rirarenga, bamuzanira abantu bose bafise ingwara zitandukanye, arambika ibiganza kuri umwumwe wese, arabakiza. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />N’impwemu mbi zikava mu bantu benshi, zisemerera ziti: “Uri Umwana w’Imana!” Ariko yaca azikankamira, akazankira kubandanya zivuga, kuko zari zizi ko ari we Mesiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bukeye mu gitondo, Yesu aja mu kibanza ciherereye. Abantu baja kumurondera, bamubonye, baramugobera ngo ntasubire kuvana na bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ariko arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ntegerezwa kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Ubwami bw’Imana no mu bindi bisagara na vyo, kuko ari co canzanye.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Nuko abandanya yigisha mu masinagogi y’i Yudaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahamagara abigishwa ba mbere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Umusi umwe Yesu yari ku nkengera y’ikiyaga c’i Genezareti, akikujwe n’isinzi ry’abantu bariko bumviriza ijambo ry’Imana. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Maze abona ubwato bubiri abarovyi bari basize ku nkengera y’ico kiyaga, bariko boza insenga zabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Nuko yurira bumwe muri bwo; kandi bwari ubwa Simoni, aca amusaba ngo abwigize gatoya mu mazi. Maze, aca abwicaramwo, atangura kwigisha abantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ahejeje kwigisha, aca abarira Simoni ati: <char style="wj">“Nimuterere insenga zanyu hagati mu kiyaga, murobe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni aramwishura ati: “Mwigisha, twakoze ijoro ryose turaruha, ariko ntitwaronka ifi n’imwe. Yamara ko ubivuze, reka nterere insenga.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Batereye insenga, baroba ifi nyishi cane, gushika n’aho insenga zitangura gutabuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Baca bahamagara bagenzi babo bari mu bundi bwato ngo baze babafashe, maze buzuza ubwato bwabo bwompi gushika aho butangura kwibira.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petero abibonye, apfukama imbere ya Yesu, amubwira ati: “Mwami, igira kure yanje kuko ndi umunyavyaha!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ivyo Petero yabivuze kubera we na bagenziwe bari batangajwe cane n’ubwinshi bw’ifi bahejeje kuroba. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Abo bagenziwe, yari Yakobo na Yohana bene Zebedayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yesu abwira Simoni ati: <char style="wj">“Ntutinye, kuko uhereye ubu, ugiye kuba umurovyi w’abantu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Baca bakwegera ubwato bwabo ku nkengera y’ikiyaga, basigaho vyose, baramukurikira.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umunyamibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu ari muri kimwe mu bisagara vy’aho hantu, haza umuntu yuzuye imibembe umubiri wose. Abonye Yesu, yikubita imbere yiwe yubamye, aramwinginga ati: “Mwami, ubishatse woshobora kumpumanura.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu aca aramvura ukuboko, amukorako. Amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ndabishatse, kira uhumanuke!”</char> Ubwo nyene imibembe ica iramuvako.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Maze Yesu aramwihaniza ati: <char style="wj">“Ntihagire umuntu n’umwe ubibwira. Ariko genda ku muherezi agusuzume, hanyuma utange ikimazi Mose yashinze ko uwuhumanutse atanga, kugira ngo bibabere ikimenyetso ko wahumanutse.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Yamara inkuru za Yesu zirushirizaho kumenyekana, abantu isinzi bakama baza aho ari kumwumviriza no kugira ngo abakize ingwara. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ariko Yesu yama aja ahantu hiherereye mu bugaragwa gusenga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu akongataye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Umusi umwe Yesu yariko arigisha, kandi bamwe mu Bafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bari ngaho; bari baje bava mu bisagara bitandukanye vy’i Galilaya, i Yudaya n’i Yerusalemu; kandi ububasha bw’Umwami Imana bwo gukiza ingwara bwari kuri Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Nuko haza abantu bateruye ku nderuzo umuntu akongataye, barondera ingene bomwinjiza mu nzu ngo bamuryamike imbere ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Babonye ko badashobora kwinjira kubera ubwinshi bw’abantu, baca burira hejuru ku nzu, basambura aho bacisha iyo nderuzo aryamyeko, bayururukiriza hagati mu bantu, imbere ya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu abonye ukwizera kwabo, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Mugenzi, ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe batangura kwiyumvira bati: “Mbega uwu ni nde aza gutuka Imana? Ni nde ashobora guharira ivyaha atari Imana yonyene?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu aca amenya ivyo bariko bariyumvira, maze arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki muriko mwiyumvira gutyo mu mitima yanyu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" /><char style="wj">Mbega icoroshe ni uko novuga nti: ‘Ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe,’ canke ni uko novuga nti: ‘Haguruka ugende’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" /><char style="wj">Ariko nshaka ko mumenya ko Umwana w’Umuntu afise ububasha kw’isi bwo guharira ivyaha.”</char> Aca ategeka wa muntu akongataye ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka, ikorere inderuzo yawe witahire.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ubwo nyene aca arahaguruka bose babibona, yikorera ico yari aryamyeko, ataha ahimbaza Imana. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Abari ngaho bose baratangara cane kandi bagira n’ubwoba, bahimbaza Imana bavuga bati: “Uwu musi amaso yacu abonye ibitangaza!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahamagara Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Yesu ariko arava muri ico gisagara, abona umutozakori yitwa Lewi yicaye aho yatoreza ikori, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nkurikira!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi aca ava hasi, aramukurikira.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Mu nyuma Lewi ategurira amazimano Yesu i muhira iwe, atumira n’abatozakori benshi n’abandi bantu, baraza basangira na bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ariko Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe babaza abigishwa ba Yesu babidodombera bati: “Ni kuki mwicarana n’abatozakori n’abandi banyavyaha, mugasangira na bo?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Abakomeye si bo bakeneye umuganga, ahubwo abagwaye ni bo bamukeneye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" /><char style="wj">Sinaje kurondera abagororotsi, ahubwo naje kurondera abanyavyaha, kugira ngo bihane.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibijanye no kwisonzesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Baca baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki abigishwa ba Yohana, co kimwe n’ab’Abafarisayo bisonzesha kenshi bakongera bagasenga, ariko abawe bakaguma birira kandi binywera nk’uko bisanzwe?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abatumire b’umukwe bokwisonzesha bakiri kumwe na we mu musi mukuru? Ntibishoboka!</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" /><char style="wj">Ariko hazogera aho umukwe abakurwamwo; ico gihe rero bazoheza bisonzeshe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Aca abacira uwu mugani ati: <char style="wj">“Nta wutabura igitambara ku mpuzu nshasha ngo akibaririre ku mpuzu y’umushire. Abikoze uko, aba yononye iyo mpuzu nshasha, kandi ico gitambara gishasha ntigishobora gufatana n’impuzu y’umushire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" /><char style="wj">Ni nk’uko ata wosuka umuvinyu mushasha mu mukuza w’urusato ushaje. Abigize uko, uwo mukuza womeneka, umuvinyu ugaseseka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" /><char style="wj">Ahubwo umuvinyu mushasha bawushira mu mukuza mushasha.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" /><char style="wj">Kandi nta muntu anywa umuvinyu wa kera ngo aheze yipfuze kunywa mushasha, kuko avuga ngo: ‘Umuvinyu wa kera ni wo uryoshe kuruta mushasha.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Umwami w’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Umusi umwe, Yesu yaciye mu mirima y’ingano, kandi hari kw’Isabato. Abigishwa biwe baca batangura guca imitwe y’ingano zeze, barazivungura, bakuramwo intete, barazirya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bamwe mu Bafarisayo baramubaza bati: “Ni kuki mukora ikizira ku musi w’Isabato?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ntimurasoma ivyo Dawidi yakoze igihe we n’abo bari kumwe bari bashonje?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><char style="wj">Yinjiye mu nzu y’Imana, afata imikate yashikaniwe Imana arayirya, yongera ahako n’abari kumwe na we; kandi abaherezi ari bo bonyene bari bemerewe kuyirya.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yongera arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umwana w’Umuntu ni Umwami w’Isabato.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ku wundi musi w’Isabato, Yesu yinjira mw’isinagogi, atangura kwigisha. Aho hari umugabo akongataye ukuboko kw’i buryo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe baca bamushinga ijisho kugira ngo barabe ko amukiza, maze bace bamwagiriza ko yakijije umuntu kw’Isabato. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ariko Yesu amenye ivyo biyumvira mu mitima, aca abarira wa mugabo akongataye ukuboko ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka uhagarare hano imbere y’ishengero!”</char> Nuko arahaguruka, ahagarara imbere.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Maze Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega icemewe gukorwa ku musi w’Isabato ni ikihe? Iciza canke ikibi? Gukiza umuntu canke kumwica?”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Nuko Yesu arabitegereza bose, maze abwira wa muntu ati: <char style="wj">“Gorora ukuboko kwawe!”</char> Akugoroye, guca kurakira. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ariko ba Bafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe barashavura cane, batangura kuja inama babazanya bati: “Yesu tumugire dute?”<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atoranya intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Umusi umwe Yesu aduga ku musozi, akesha ijoro ryose asenga Imana. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bukeye, akoranya abigishwa biwe bose, atoranyamwo cumi na babiri, abagira intumwa. Na bo ni aba:<verse eid="LUK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni, uwo Yesu yise Petero, mwene nyina Andereya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yohana,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Filipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Baruteremi,<verse eid="LUK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Yakobo mwene Alufayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Simoni Umuzelote,<verse eid="LUK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwene Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">na Yuda Isikariyote, ari we yahavuye amugurisha.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yerekana abahiriwe abo ari bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Hanyuma Yesu ava kuri uwo musozi amanukana na bo, bashika ahantu hateze, bahasanga abigishwa biwe benshi, hamwe n’abandi bantu isinzi bari baje bava i Yudaya, i Yerusalemu, no mu micungararo y’intara za Tiro na Sidoni yegereye ikiyaga, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />bazanywe no kumwumviriza no kugira ngo abakize ingwara. Nuko abari baboshwe n’impwemu mbi barakira, <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />kandi abantu bose bagerageza kumukorako, kuko ububasha bwo gukiza ingwara bwamuvamwo bugakiza abantu bose.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Nuko Yesu yitegereza abigishwa biwe, aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">“Murahiriwe mwebwe mwumva ko mukenye,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">kuko Ubwami bw’Imana ari ubwanyu.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />
    <char style="wj">Murahiriwe mwebwe mushonje muri kino gihe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">kuko muzohazwa.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Murahiriwe mwebwe murira muri kino gihe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">kuko muzotwenga.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <char style="wj">Muzoba muhiriwe abantu nibabanka,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">bakabakumira, bakabatuka,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">bakabavuga nabi nk’inkozi z’ibibi,</char></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">babahora Umwana w’Umuntu.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />
    <char style="wj">Ico gihe muze munezerwe kuko impera yanyu izoba ari nini mw’ijuru. Kandi mwibuke ko ba sekuruza babo ari ko bagiriye abavugishwa n’Imana ba kera.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko muragowe mwebwe abatunzi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">kuko mumaze kuronka umunezero wanyu.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />
    <char style="wj">Muragowe mwebwe muhaze muri kino gihe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">kuko muzosonza.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Muragowe mwebwe mutwenga muri kino gihe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">kuko muzobabara muboroge.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />
    <char style="wj">Muragowe mwebwe mushimagizwa na bose,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">kuko uko ari ko ba sekuruza babo bashimagiza abavugishwa b’ibinyoma.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukunde abansi banyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ndababwire mwebwe munyumva: mukunde abansi banyu, mugirire neza ababanka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" /><char style="wj">Muhezagire ababavuma, musengere ababagirira nabi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" /><char style="wj">Nihagira uwugukubita mu musaya umwe, umuhindukirize n’uwundi. Hagize uwugutwara ikoti, umuhebere n’ishati na yo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" /><char style="wj">Umuntu niyagusaba ikintu ukimuhe, uwukunyaze ivyawe ubimuhebere.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><char style="wj">Ivyo mugomba ko abantu babagirira, abe ari vyo mubagirira namwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwakunda ababakunda gusa, muzoba murushije iki abandi? Kuko n’abanyavyaha bakunda ababakunda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" /><char style="wj">Kandi nimwagirira neza ababagirira neza gusa, muzoba murushije iki abandi? Mbega abanyavyaha bo ntibabigenza batyo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" /><char style="wj">Nimwagurana abo mwizeye ko bazobasubiza bonyene, muzoba murushije iki abandi? Mbega abanyavyaha bo ntibagurana abo bizeye ko bazobasubiza yose?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" /><char style="wj">Ariko, mukunde abansi banyu, mubagirire neza. Mubagurane mutiteze ko babasubiza, ni ho impera yanyu izoba nini mw’ijuru. Aho muzoba mwerekanye vy’ukuri ko muri abana b’Iyisumbavyose, kuko igirira neza intashima n’abanyakibi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" /><char style="wj">Mugire impuhwe nk’uko So wo mw’ijuru ari umunyempuhwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntimugacire imanza abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <char style="wj">Ntimugacire imanza abandi, kugira ngo namwe ntimuzozicirwe. Ntimugatsindishe abandi, kugira ngo namwe ntimuzotsindishwe. Mugire imbabazi, ni ho namwe muzozigirirwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" /><char style="wj">Mutange, namwe muzohabwa. Ingero nziza, itsindagiye, inyingishe kandi isesekaye ni yo muzogererwa. Kuko ingero mugereramwo abandi ari yo namwe muzogererwamwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu abacira n’uwu mugani ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega impumyi yorongora iyindi? Zose ntizohava zigwa mu kinogo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><char style="wj">Umwigishwa ntaruta umwigisha, ariko umwigishwa yigishijwe neza amera nk’umwigisha wiwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />
    <char style="wj">Ni kuki ushinga ijisho akatsi kari mu jisho rya mugenzawe, ariko ntiwiteho inkingi y’igiti iri mu jisho ryawe?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" /><char style="wj">Ni kuki ubwira mugenzawe uti: ‘Tega ndagutosore akatsi kari mu jisho,’ kandi nawe ugendana inkingi y’igiti mu jisho ryawe? Wa ndyarya we, tangura ukure inkingi y’igiti iri mu jisho ryawe, ni ho uzobona neza akatsi kari mu jisho rya mugenzawe, uheze ugakureyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igiti n’ivyamwa vyaco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />
    <char style="wj">Nta giti ciza cama ivyamwa bibi, kandi nta giti kibi cama ivyamwa vyiza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" /><char style="wj">Igiti cose kimenyekanira ku vyamwa vyaco. Nta wokwamura inzabibu ku bisaka vy’amahwa, nk’uko ata wokwamura insukoni ku mitobotobo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><char style="wj">Umuntu mwiza akura ivyiza mu bubiko bwiza bw’umutima wiwe, umubi na we agakura ibibi mu bubiko bubi bw’umutima wiwe. Kuko ivyuzuye mu mutima ni vyo akanwa kavuga.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwubaka ku rutare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <char style="wj">Ni kuki mumpamagara ngo: ‘Mwami, Mwami,’ ariko ntimukore ivyo ndababwira?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese aza aho ndi akumva amajambo yanje hanyuma akayashira mu ngiro, ngira ndabereke uko ameze:</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" /><char style="wj">ameze nk’umwubatsi yimvye cane akubaka umushinge w’inzu yiwe ku rutare. Iyo hateye umwuzure, inzuzi zigasuriranya, iyo nzu ntishobora kunyiganyiga kuko yubatse neza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" /><char style="wj">Ariko uwumva amajambo yanje ntayashire mu ngiro, ameze nk’uwubaka inzu kw’isi ahatagira umushinge. Iyo inzuzi zisuriranije kuri ya nzu, irasenyuka kandi isenyuka ryayo riba irikomeye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwizera kw’umusoda w’Umuroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu ahejeje kwigisha abantu muri ayo majambo yose, aca aja i Kaperinawumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Aho hari umusoda mukuru w’Umuroma yari afise umukozi yakunda cane. Uwo mukozi yari agwaye, ari hafi yo gupfa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yumvise inkuru za Yesu, aca arungika bamwe mu bakuru b’Abayuda, ngo bamwinginge aze akize umukozi wiwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bashitse aho Yesu ari, baramwinginga bashimitse bati: “Uwu muntu birakwiye ko umufasha, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kuko arakunda ihanga ryacu kandi yaratwubakiye n’isinagogi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu aca ajana na bo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Ari hafi yo gushika, wa musoda aca arungika abagenzi biwe ngo baje kumubwira bati: “Mwami, ntiwirirwe urigora, kuko ntibimbereye kukwakira mu nzu yanje. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Simbereye no kuza aho uri ngo duhure. Ariko vuga ijambo rimwe gusa, umukozi wanje arakira. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kuko nanje ndafise abantegeka kandi mfise n’abasoda ntegeka. Iyo mbwiye umwe nti: ‘Genda,’ aca agenda; nabwira uwundi nti: ‘Ngwino,’ agaca aza; kandi iyo mbwiye umukozi wanje nti ‘Kora iki,’ aca agikora.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu avyumvise aratangara cane, aca arahindukira abarira abo bari kumwe ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, sinari bwabone uwufise ukwizera gukomeye nk’uku no muri Isirayeli.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Maze bamwe bari batumwe baragaruka, basanga wa mukozi yakize.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asubiza ubuzima uwapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Inyuma y’ivyo Yesu aca amanuka mu gisagara citwa Nayini, ari kumwe n’abigishwa hamwe n’isinzi ry’abantu bamukurikiye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ageze hafi y’irembo ry’igisagara, haza abantu bagiye guhamba umuntu. Yari umuhungu w’ikinege kandi nyina yari umupfakazi. Hariho kandi n’isinzi ry’abantu bo muri ico gisagara bari bamuherekeje. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Umwami Yesu abonye uwo muvyeyi, amugirira impuhwe, aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Reka kurira!”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Maze Yesu yegera isandugu yarimwo ikiziga, abari bayiteruye baca barahagarara. Hanyuma avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Muhungu, ndakubwiye, haguruka!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Wa muhungu yari yapfuye aravyuka, atangura kuvuga, Yesu aca amusubiza nyina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Abari aho bose baterwa n’ubwoba, bongera bashima Imana, bati: “Uwuvugishwa n’Imana ahambaye yatwiyeretse, Imana yaje gutabara abantu bayo.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nuko inkuru ya Yesu ikwira i Yudaya hose no mu micungararo yaho.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yohana Umubatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Maze abigishwa ba Yohana Umubatizi baragenda bamubwira ivyo Yesu ariko arakora vyose. Aca ahamagara babiri muri bo, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />abatuma kubaza Umwami Yesu bati: “Mbega ni wewe twari twiteze ko uzoza canke twitege uwundi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Bashikiriye Yesu bamubwira bati: “Yohana Umubatizi adutumye ngo tukubaze: ‘Woba uri umwe yategerezwa kuza, canke turindire uwundi?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ako kanya nyene Yesu aca akiza abantu benshi bari bafise ingwara n’ubumuga butandukanye, ababoshwe n’impwemu mbi, ahumura n’impumyi nyinshi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Maze abarira ba bigishwa ati: <char style="wj">“Genda mubarire Yohana ivyo mwabonye n’ivyo mwumvise: abahumye barahumuka, abamugaye baragenda, abanyamibembe barahumanuka, abatumva barumva, abapfuye barazuka, kandi aboro barabwirwa Ubutumwa Bwiza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Hahiriwe umuntu adatsitazwa n’ivyanje.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ba bigishwa bamaze kugenda, Yesu aca atangura kuvuga ivyerekeye Yohana Umubatizi, ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mwagiye kuraba iki mu bugaragwa? Ni irenga rizungagizwa n’umuyaga?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" /><char style="wj">Nimba atari uko, mwari mwagiye kuraba iki? Umuntu yambaye impuzu z’igiciro kinini? Si vyo, kuko abambara impuzu z’igiciro kinini, n’abiyamira mu bikayangana baba mu ngoro z’abami.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" /><char style="wj">None mwagiye kuraba iki? Uwuvugishwa n’Imana? Ego cane, mbere ndababwiye ko mwagiye kuraba uwuruta uwuvugishwa n’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwo ni we Ivyanditswe bivugako ngo:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">‘Ngira ndungike intumwa yanje imbere yawe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">igutegurire inzira.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, mu bantu bose bavyawe n’abagore, nta wuruta Yohana; ariko umuntu mutoya musi y’abandi mu Bwami bw’Imana arahambaye kumuruta.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Maze abantu bose, harimwo n’abatozakori, bumvise ayo majambo ya Yesu, baca baremera ko inzira z’Imana zigororotse, kuko bari babatijwe na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ariko Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bo baranse umugambi w’Imana kuri bo, kuko banse ko Yohana ababatiza.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu yongera kubabwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega ab’uru runganwe nobagereranya n’iki? Bameze gute?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" /><char style="wj">Bameze nk’abana bicaye ku mbuga, bahamagara bagenzi babo bakababarira bati:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">‘Twabavugirije umwironge,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">ariko ntimwatamvye;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">hanyuma tubaririmbira indirimbo z’ikigandaro,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">ntimwarira.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />
    <char style="wj">Kuko Yohana Umubatizi yaje atarya, atanywa n’umuvinyu, muca muvuga ngo: ‘Arimwo dayimoni.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" /><char style="wj">Umwana w’Umuntu na we aza arya, kandi anywa, muca muvuga ngo: ‘Ni umukunzi w’inda kandi ni imborerwa, agendana n’abatozakori n’abandi banyavyaha.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" /><char style="wj">Ariko icerekana ubwenge bw’Imana ni ubuzima bw’ababwakiriye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asigwa amavuta n’umugore w’umunyavyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Maze umwe mu Bafarisayo atumira Yesu ngo amuzimane. Nuko Yesu aragenda, yinjira mu nzu yiwe, yicara ku meza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Hanyuma umugore umwe wo muri ico gisagara yari azwi nk’umunyavyaha yumva ko Yesu ariko afungurira mu nzu y’uwo Mufarisayo. Aca aza azanye icupa ririmwo amavuta amota cane y’igiciro kinini, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />apfukama i ruhande y’ibirenge vya Yesu arira, ajojotereza amosozi yiwe ku birenge vya Yesu, abihanaguza umushatsi wiwe, arabisomagura yongera abisiga ya mavuta.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Wa Mufarisayo yamutumira abibonye, atangura kwivugana mu mutima ati: “Iyaba uwu muntu yari uwuvugishwa n’Imana, yari kumenya uwuriko aramukorako, n’ubuzima bw’uwo mugore, ko ari umunyavyaha.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu aca aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni, ndafise ico ndakubwira.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni na we ati: “Mbarira, Mwigisha!”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu aca amucira umugani ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye muntu yaguranye idenariyo abantu babiri. Umwe amuha amajana atanu, uwundi mirongo itanu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" /><char style="wj">Abonye ata n’umwe muri abo ashoboye kumwishura, aca azibahebera bompi. None ni nde muri abo babiri azomukunda cane?”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni na we arishura ati: “Nibaza ko ari uwo yahebewe menshi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Wishuye neza.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Aca arahindukira araba wa mugore, hanyuma abwira Simoni ati: <char style="wj">“Wabonye uwu mugore? Aho ninjira mu nzu yawe ntiwampaye amazi yo kwoza ibirenge, ariko we yatotesheje ibirenge vyanje n’amosozi yiwe, abihanaguza umushatsi wiwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" /><char style="wj">Ntiwangumbiriye mu kundamutsa, ariko kuva ninjira ntahengeshanya kunsomagura ku birenge.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" /><char style="wj">Ntiwansize amavuta ku mutwe, ariko we yansize amavuta amota cane ku birenge.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma, nanje ndakubwiye ko, yerekanye urukundo rwinshi kuko yahariwe ivyaha vyiwe vyinshi. Ariko uwahariwe bike, yerekana urukundo ruke.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu aca abarira wa mugore ati: <char style="wj">“Ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Abandi batumire baca batangura kubazanya bati: “Mbega uwu ni nde, aho yubahuka kuvuga ko aharira abantu ivyaha?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu aca abarira wa mugore ati: <char style="wj">“Ukwizera kwawe gutumye uronka agakiza, igire amahoro.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umubivyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Hanyuma y’ivyo, Yesu agendagenda mu bisagara no mu mihana, avuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Ubwami bw’Imana. Bamwe cumi na babiri bari kumwe na we, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />hamwe n’abagore yabohoye baboshwe n’impwemu mbi, akabakiza n’izindi ngwara, ari bo Mariya Magadalena yirukanywemwo abadayimoni indwi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yowana muka Kuza; umunyabigega wa Herode, Suzana hamwe n’abandi benshi. Abo bagore bashigikira Yesu n’abigishwa biwe bakoresheje uburyo bwabo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Umusi umwe, abantu benshi bari bakoranye bavuye mu bisagara bitandukanye, maze Yesu abacira uwu mugani ati: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" /><char style="wj">“Habaye umurimyi yagiye kubiba imbuto ziwe. Ariko arabiba, zimwe zigwa i ruhande y’inzira, maze abantu barazihonyanga, kandi inyoni zo mu kirere ziraza zirazinobagura.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" /><char style="wj">Izindi zigwa ku rutare; zimeze zica ziruma kuko hatari habomvye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" /><char style="wj">Izindi na zo zigwa mu mahwa; zimeze zikurana na yo, aca arazinyoha.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" /><char style="wj">Ariko hariho n’izaguye mw’ivu ryiza, zirakura kandi zirama, zimbuka incuro ijana.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Ahejeje kubacira uwo mugani, yongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Uwufise amatwi yumva, niyumve.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Abigishwa biwe baca bamubaza insiguro y’uwo mugani. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Na we ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni mwebwe mwahawe kumenya amabanga y’ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana. Ariko ku bandi nkoresha imigani kugira ngo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">‘naho baraba ntibabone,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">kandi naho bumviriza ntibatahure.’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Yesaya 6:9</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />
    <char style="wj">Iyi ni yo nsiguro y’uwu mugani: imbuto ni ijambo ry’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" /><char style="wj">Imbuto zaguye aho abantu baca, ni abantu bumva Ijambo ry’Imana, ariko Satani agaca aza akarikura mu mitima yabo kugira ngo ntibizere, maze ngo bakizwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" /><char style="wj">Imbuto zaguye ku rutare: ni abantu bakirana umunezero, ijambo ry’Imana, ariko kubera batarireka ngo rishinge imizi muri bo, bizera akanya gato. Hagize ibibagerageza, baca bata ukwizera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" /><char style="wj">Imbuto zaguye mu mahwa: ni abantu bamaze kwumva ijambo ry’Imana, imyitwarariko y’ivy’ubu buzima, ubutunzi n’ibihimbaro vy’iyi si bica biza bikanyoha iryo jambo ryatewe muri bo, hanyuma mu buzima bwabo ntibigere bakura, ngo bame imbuto nziza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" /><char style="wj">Ariko imbuto zaguye mw’ivu ryiza, ni abantu bamaze kwumva ijambo ry’Imana, baryakirana umutima mwiza kandi ukunze, maze bakarigumya; hanyuma kubera ukwihangana, bakama ivyamwa vyinshi.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’itara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <char style="wj">Nta wudomeka itara hanyuma ngo aryubikeko igiseke canke ngo arinyegeze musi y’uburiri. Ahubwo aritereka ku giterekwako itara kugira ngo riboneshereze abinjira mu nzu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" /><char style="wj">Kuko ata canyegejwe kitazoshirwa ahabona, kandi ata cagizwe ibanga kitazomenyekana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero mwiyubare ku vyo mwumva. Uwufise azokwongererezwa, uwudafise na we azokwakwa n’ivyo yari afise.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyina wa Yesu na bene nyina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nyina wa Yesu na bene nyina baje kumuraba babura aho baca ngo bamushikire kuko hari abantu benshi cane. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Umuntu umwe aca amubwira ati: “Nyoko na bene nyoko bahagaze hanze, bariko barakurondera.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu amwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mama na bene mama ni abo bumva ijambo ry’Imana bakaryumvira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahagarika imipfunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Umusi umwe Yesu yabariye abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Tujabuke tuje hakurya y’ikiyaga.”</char> Nuko batambukira mu bwato, bafata urugendo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Bakiriko barasoza, Yesu arasinzira. Haca haduka umuyaga mwinshi mu kiyaga, maze ubwato butangura kwuzura amazi; bari bageramiwe cane.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Abigishwa baca baja kumuvyura bavuga bati: “Mwigisha, mwigisha, turapfuye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Nuko aravyuka akankamira uwo muyaga n’imipfunda, igihuhusi kirahagarara, ubwo nyene haba agahwekere! <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu aca abaza ba bigishwa ati: <char style="wj">“Ukwizera kwanyu kuri he?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Maze baratangara, bagira n’ubwoba bwinshi, batangura kubazanya bati: “Mbega uwu ni umuntu ki? Ategeka umuyaga n’amazi kandi bikamwumvira!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umugabo yaboshwe n’abadayimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Nuko barasoza bashika mu ntara ya Gerasene, hakurya y’ikiyaga harabana n’i Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu atambukiye ku nkengera y’ikiyaga, asanganirwa n’umugabo yarimwo abadayimoni, aje ava mu gisagara. Yari amaze igihe kirekire atambara impuzu canke ngo abe mu nzu; yaba mw’itongo ry’abapfuye. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Abonye Yesu, aca akoma induru, yikubita ku birenge vyiwe, asemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Undonderako iki ga Yesu, Mwana w’Imana Musumbavyose? Ndakwinginze ntunkubagure imibabaro!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ivyo yabivuze kuko Yesu yari yategetse iyo mpwemu mbi kumuvamwo. Kenshi iyo mpwemu mbi imufashe, naho bamubohesha iminyororo n’amaguru yiwe bakayashira mu vyuma kugira ngo agume hamwe, yarabicagagura, iyo mpwemu mbi igaca imutwara kuyerera mu gahinga.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu arayibaza ati: <char style="wj">“Witwa nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Na yo iramwishura iti: “Nitwa Gitero,” kuko yarimwo abadayimoni benshi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Abo badayimoni binginga Yesu ngo ntabarungike i kuzimu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Hafi y’aho hari umukuku w’ingurube nyinshi zari ziragiwe ku musozi. Abo badayimoni binginga Yesu ngo abarungike muri izo ngurube, maze arabemerera. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Nuko ba badayimoni bava muri wa muntu, binjira muri za ngurube, na zo ziriruka zimanuka, zisuka mu kiyaga ziradwibira, zicwa n’amazi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Abari baragiye izo ngurube babibonye baca bariruka, baja kubivuga mu gisagara no mu mihana. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Maze abantu bava mu gisagara baza kuraba ivyabaye. Bashitse aho Yesu ari, babona uwo muntu yavuyemwo abadayimoni, yicaye imbere ya Yesu, yambaye kandi afise ubwenge bukwiye, na bo bagira ubwoba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ababonye uko vyagenze baca babiganira ingene uwo muntu yari aboshwe n’abadayimoni yakize. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Nuko abantu bose bo mu ntara y’Abagerasene binginga Yesu ngo abavireho, kuko bari bagize ubwoba bwinshi. Yesu aca yurira ubwato arigira.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Wa mugabo yakize abadayimoni yinginga Yesu ngo bajane, ariko Yesu aramurungika, amubwira ati: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" /><char style="wj">“Subira i muhira ubarire abantu ivyo Imana yagukoreye.”</char> Wa muntu aca arataha aca hose mu gisagara, agenda arabwira abantu ivyo Yesu yamukoreye.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umukobwa yari yapfuye n’umugore yari agwaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu asubiye inyuma asanganirwa n’abantu benshi cane bari bamurindiriye. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Umugabo yitwa Yayiro, yari umukuru w’isinagogi, araza yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vya Yesu aramwinginga ngo bajane i muhira iwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kuko umukobwa wiwe yariko aracikana. Yari amufise ari umwe kandi yari afise imyaka nka cumi n’ibiri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu ari mu nzira agenda, yari akikijwe n’abantu benshi bamugunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Hariho umugore yari amaze imyaka cumi n’ibiri agwaye ingwara yo mu gitereko yo kuguma ava amaraso, vyaranse ko akira. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Aca yegera Yesu amuturutse inyuma, akora ku musozo w’impuzu yiwe. Ubwo nyene kwa kuva amaraso guca kurahera.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu na we aca arabaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni nde ankozeko?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Bose babihakanye, Petero amubwira ati: “Mwigisha, abantu ni benshi kandi bariko barakugunda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Hari umuntu yankozeko kuko hari ubushobozi numvise bumvuyemwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Wa mugore abonye ko ico yakoze camenyekanye, aca aza ajugumira, yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vya Yesu, amubwirira imbere ya bose icatumye amukorako, kandi ko yaciye akira ako kanya nyene. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu aca aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwana wanje, ukwizera kwawe kuragukijije. Igire amahoro.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Akiriko aravuga, haza umuntu avuye kwa Yayiro, wa mukuru w’isinagogi, amubwira ati: “Umukobwa wawe yamaze gucikana. Nta co ubandanya ugora umwigisha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu nawe avyumvise aca abwira Yayiro ati: <char style="wj">“Ntutinye, ariko wizere gusa, araja gukira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ashitse mu nzu kwa Yayiro ntiyemera ko hagira umuntu n’umwe binjirana, kiretse Petero, Yohana, na Yakobo, hamwe na se na nyina b’uwo mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ico gihe abantu bose bariko baramuririra. Yesu arababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Nta co murira kuko ntiyapfuye, ahubwo arasinziriye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Na bo baramutwenga, kuko bari bazi neza ko umwana yapfuye. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu aca afata ukuboko kwa wa mukobwa, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwana wanje, vyuka!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ubwo nyene impwemu yiwe imusubiramwo, arahaguruka. Maze Yesu ababwira ngo bamugaburire. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Abavyeyi biwe baratangara cane, ariko Yesu arabihanikiriza ngo ntihagire uwo babwira ivyabaye.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu arungika bamwe cumi na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu akoranya bamwe cumi na babiri, abaha ububasha bwo kwirukana abadayimoni no gukiza ingwara, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />aca abarungika kwigisha ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana no gukiza abagwaye. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Arababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Ntihagire ikintu na kimwe mujana ku rugendo, yaba inkoni, umufuko, ivyokurya, amahera, canke impuzu zo gukuranya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" /><char style="wj">Aho bazobakira, muzogume muri iyo nzu nyene gushika muvuye muri ico gisagara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" /><char style="wj">Aho batazobakira, muzokunkumure umukungugu wo mu birenge vyanyu, kugira ngo bizobabere icagiriji.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Nuko baca bafata inzira, baca mu mihana itandukanye, bavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, bakiza n’abagwaye aho baca hose.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Herode Antipa yumvise ivyo Yesu akora, arazazanirwa, kuko hariho abavuga ko yoba ari Yohana Umubatizi yazutse mu bapfuye, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />abandi bakavuga ko yoba ari Eliya yabiyeretse, abandi na bo bakibaza ngo ni umwe mu bavugishwa n’Imana ba kera yoba yazutse mu bapfuye. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ariko Herode aravuga ati: “Ko Yohana ari jewe namuciye umutwe, uwo we numva ni nde?” Ni ko guca arondera ingene yomubona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahaza abantu ibihumbi bitanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Intumwa zigarutse ziganira Yesu ivyo zakoze vyose. Yesu aca ajana na bo baja ahiherereye, aharabana n’igisagara citwa Betesayida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />ariko abantu barabimenya, baca baramukurikira. Yesu arabakira, aca atangura kubabwira ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana, akiza n’abari bagwaye.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Buriko burira, bamwe cumi na babiri baza aho Yesu ari bamubwira bati: “Erega rungika aba bantu baje mu bisagara no mu mihana kurondera ivyokurya n’indaro, kuko turi mu gahinga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nimubagaburire mwebwe nyene.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Na bo bamubwira bati: “Dufise imikate itanu n’ifi zibiri gusa. None ushaka ko tuja gusuma ibikwiye isinzi ry’abantu nk’iri?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Ico gihe hari abagabo nk’ibihumbi bitanu.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Ariko Yesu abarira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Nimubicarike mu migwi ya mirongo itanu itanu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Nuko abantu bose baricara. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Aca afata ya mikate itanu na za fi zibiri, araba mw’ijuru, abishimira Imana. Hanyuma arabimanyagura, abihereza abigishwa ngo bagaburire abantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bose bararya kandi barahaga. Hanyuma abigishwa begeranya ibiseke cumi na bibiri vyuzuye utumanyu twasigaye.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero yatura ko Yesu ari Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Umusi umwe Yesu yariko arasenga yiherereye, ari kumwe n’abigishwa biwe. Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abantu bavuga ko ndi nde?”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Baramwishura bati: “Bamwe bavuga ngo uri Yohana Umubatizi, abandi ngo uri Eliya, abandi na bo ngo uri umwe mu bavugishwa n’Imana ba kera yazutse.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Aca arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“None mweho muvuga ko ndi nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petero aramwishura ati: “Uri Kristo yaje ava ku Mana.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ivyerekeye urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu aca arabihaniza ashimitse ngo ntihagire uwo babibwira. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ivyo biheze, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umwana w’Umuntu ategerezwa kubabazwa mu buryo bwinshi, akankwa n’abatware, n’abaherezi bakurubakuru, n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe. Kandi azokwicwa hanyuma azuke ku musi ugira gatatu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yongera kubabwirira bose hamwe ati: <char style="wj">“Uwugomba kunkurikira, ni yihebe, yikorere umusaraba wiwe ku musi ku musi, ankurikire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwugomba gukiza ubugingo bwiwe azobubura, ariko uwubuheba ku bwanje azobukiza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" /><char style="wj">Umuntu vyomumarira iki yungutse ivyo mw’isi vyose, ariko akabura ubugingo bwiwe canke akabutikiza?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" /><char style="wj">Umuntu wese azogira isoni zo kunyemera no kwemera amajambo yanje, Umwana w’Umuntu na we azogira isoni zo kumwemera niyagaruka ari mu bwiza bwiwe, mu bwa Data no mu bw’abamarayika biwe bera.</char><verse eid="LUK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, bamwe mu bo turi kumwe hano ntibazopfa batabonye Ubwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ugukayangana kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Haheze nk’imisi umunani Yesu ababwiye ivyo, aca ajana Petero, Yohana na Yakobo, baduga ku musozi gusenga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Akiriko arasenga, mu maso hiwe hahinduka ukundi, impuzu ziwe zirakayangana, zica ibibatsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ubwo nyene haboneka abantu babiri: Mose na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bari mu bwiza bw’Imana, batangura kuganira na Yesu, bavugana ingene yari agiye kurangiza igikorwa ciwe mu gupfira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petero na bagenziwe bari basinziriye cane; bikanguye babona ubwiza bwa Yesu, na ba bagabo bari bahagararanye na we. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mose na Eliya bakiriko baratandukana na Yesu, Petero aramubarira ati: “Mwigisha, bitubereye vyiza kuba hano. Reka tuhashinge amahema atatu: iryawe, irya Mose, n’irya Eliya.” (Ariko Petero ntiyari azi ivyo ariko aravuga.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Akiriko aravuga, igicu kiraza kirabapfuka. Abo bigishwa bagira ubwoba bwinshi igicu kibatwikiriye. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Maze humvikana ijwi muri ico gicu, rivuga riti: “Uwu ni Umwana wanje natoranije. Nimumwumvirize!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Iryo jwi rihejeje kwumvikana, basanga Yesu asigaye ari wenyene. Ba bigishwa baca barahora, muri iyo misi ntibabwira umuntu n’umwe ivyo babonye.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuhungu aboshwe n’impwemu mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Bukeye, bariko baramanuka bava kuri uwo musozi, abantu benshi baza gusanganira Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Umwe muri abo bantu arasemerera ati: “Ndakwinginze untabarire umuhungu wanje, kuko ndamufise ari umwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Impwemu mbi imufashe, aca atangura gukoma induru, hanyuma ikamujegeza, agaca abimba ifuro mu kanwa. Iramubabaza cane kandi imurekura asa nk’uwapfuye. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ninginze abigishwa bawe ngo bayirukane ariko vyabananiye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Yemwe bantu b’iki gihe mutizera kandi mwononekaye mu mitima, nzobana namwe gushika ryari ndabihanganira? Zana uwo muhungu wawe hano.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Bariko baramuzana, ya dayimoni imukubita hasi iramujegeza. Ariko Yesu akankamira iyo mpwemu ihumanye, akiza uwo muhungu, amusubiza se. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Abari ngaho bose batangazwa cane n’ububasha bukomeye bw’Imana.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu asubira kuvuga ivyerekeye urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bagitangajwe n’ivyo yari ahejeje gukora, Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" /><char style="wj">“Nimunyumvirize neza kandi mushire umutima ku vyo ngira ndababwire: Umwana w’Umuntu agiye gutabwa mu maboko y’abantu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ariko abigishwa bo ntibatahura ico ababwiye. Insiguro y’ayo majambo yari ihishijwe, bituma batayimenya, kandi batinya no kugira ico babimubazako.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Maze haduka impari hagati mu bigishwa bashaka kumenya umukuru muri bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu amenye ivyo bariko bariyumvira mu mitima, aca ahamagara umwana mutoya amuhagarika i ruhande yiwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Arababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Uwakira umwana muto nk’uwu mw’izina ryanje ni jewe aba yakiriye; kandi uwunyakiriye wese aba yakiriye uwantumye. Uwa nyuma muri mwebwe ni we mukuru muri mwese.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana aramubwira ati: “Mwigisha, twabonye umuntu yirukana abadayimoni mw’izina ryawe, duca turamubuza kuko atari kumwe natwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ntimukamubuze, kuko uwutabagwanya aba ari ku ruhande rwanyu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ab’i Samariya banka kwakira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Igihe ciwe co kuduzwa mw’ijuru cegereje, Yesu afata ingingo yo kuja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Aca arungika abamwitangira imbere, baja mu mihana y’i Samariya kugira ngo bamutegurire aho azoshikira. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ariko abantu baho banka kumwakira kuko yari ahaciye aja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Abigishwa biwe Yohana na Yakobo babibonye, babaza Yesu bati: “Mwami, duhamagare umuriro ukoroke uvuye mw’ijuru ubatongore?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu aca arahindukira, arabakankamira [ati: <char style="wj">“Ntimuzi impwemu ibakoresha iyo ari yo! Umwana w’Umuntu ntiyazanywe no guhonya abantu, ahubwo yazanywe no kubakiza.”</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nuko baca baja mu yindi mihana.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gukurikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Bari mu nzira bagenda, umuntu umwe araza abarira Yesu ati: “Nditeguye kugukurikira aho uja hose.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Imbwebwe zirafise imyobo zibamwo n’inyoni zo mu kirere zirafise ivyari, ariko Umwana w’Umuntu ntagira n’aho akika umusaya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu aca abarira uwundi muntu ati: <char style="wj">“Nkurikira.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ariko wa muntu aramwishura ati: “Mwami, banza undeke ngende mpambe data.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Reka abapfuye mu mpwemu bahambe abapfuye babo, ariko wewe genda uvuge ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Hanyuma uwundi na we araza avuga ati: “Mwami, ndagukurikira, ariko reka mbanze ngende nsezere umuryango wanje.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Nta muntu araba inyuma ariko ararimisha inka aba abereye Ubwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu arungika abandi bigishwa mirongo indwi na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ivyo biheze, Umwami Yesu atoranya abandi bigishwa mirongo indwi na babiri, abarungika ari babiribabiri, ngo babe baramwitangira imbere mu bisagara n’ahandi hantu hose yari yimirije kuja. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Arababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Ivyimburwa ni vyinshi, ariko abimbuzi ni bake. Nimwinginge nyene ivyimburwa arungike abimbuzi mu vyimburwa vyiwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><char style="wj">Nimugende! Ndabarungitse nk’intama mu bikoko vy’inkazi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><char style="wj">Ntihagire amahera, isakoshi canke ibirato vyo gukuranya mwitwaza; kandi ntimuramutse abantu mu nzira.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />
    <char style="wj">Igihe cose mwinjiye mu nzu y’umuntu, muzobanze muramutse muti: ‘Amahoro abe muri iyi nzu.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Nimwasanga abo muri iyo nzu ari abanyamahoro, umuhezagiro wanyu uzoba kuri bo. Atari uko na ho, umuhezagiro wanyu uzobagarukako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><char style="wj">Muze mugume muri iyo nzu nyene, murya kandi munywa ivyo babahaye, kuko umukozi wese abereye impembo yiwe. Ntimuze muve mu nzu muja mu yindi.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwinjira mu gisagara bakabakira, muzofungure ivyo muhasanze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" /><char style="wj">Mukize abagwaye, mwongere mubabwire muti ‘Ubwami bw’Imana burabegereye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><char style="wj">Ariko nimwinjira mu gisagara ntibabakire, muzoje mu mayira yaho, muvuge muti:</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" /><char style="wj">‘N’umukungugu wo mu gisagara canyu uri ku birenge vyacu turawukunkumuye kugira ngo bibabere icagiriji, ariko mumenye neza ko Ubwami bw’Imana bubegereye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, ku musi w’imanza, i Sodomu hazogira agahengekerezo kurusha ico gisagara.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <char style="wj">Uzobona ibara, yewe Korazini! Uzobona ibara yewe Betesayida! Kuko iyo ibitangaza vyakorewe iwanyu bikorerwa i Tiro n’i Sidoni, abaho baba barihanye kuva kera, bakambara amagunira, bakisiga n’iminyota.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" /><char style="wj">Ariko ku musi w’imanza, i Tiro n’i Sidoni hazogira agahengekerezo kurusha mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><char style="wj">Nawe Kaperinawumu, mbega wibaza ko uzoduzwa gushika mw’ijuru? Haba na mba! Ahubwo uzokororerwa i Kuzimu mu kibanza c’abapfuye.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <char style="wj">Uwubumvira ni jewe aba yumviye, kandi uwubanka ni jewe aba yanse. Uwunyanse na we aba yanse uwantumye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bamwe mirongo indwi na babiri bagarutse, baza bafise umunezero mwinshi bavuga bati: “Mwami, n’abadayimoni batwumvira mw’izina ryawe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nabonye Satani akoroka nk’umuravyo ava mw’ijuru.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><char style="wj">Raba, narabahaye ububasha bwo kunesha ubushobozi bwose bw’umwansi: muzohonyora inzoka na sikoropiyo muzimene imitwe, kandi nta na kimwe kizogira ico kibagira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" /><char style="wj">Ariko ntimunezerwe n’uko impwemu mbi zibumvira, ahubwo munezerwe n’uko amazina yanyu yanditse mw’ijuru.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Muri ako kanya, Yesu yuzura umunezero muri Mpwemu Yera, aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ndagushima Data, Mwami w’ijuru n’isi, kuko ivyo wabihishije abanyabwenge n’abize, ukabihishurira abameze nk’abana bato. Egome Data, kuko uko ari ko washimye kubikora.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <char style="wj">Data yaranyizigiye anzeza vyose. Nta n’umwe azi Umwana atari Data, kandi nta n’umwe azi Data atari Umwana, n’uwo Umwana ahisemwo kumuhishurira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Maze arahindukira, abwira abigishwa biwe bonyene ati: <char style="wj">“Hahiriwe amaso abona ivyo muriko murabona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" /><char style="wj">Kuko ndababwira ko abavugishwa n’Imana n’abami benshi bipfuje kubona ivyo muriko murabona ariko ntibabibona, no kwumva ivyo muriko murumva, ariko ntibavyumva.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusamariya w’impuhwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Umusi umwe, umwigisha w’ivyagezwe yavuye hasi kugira ngo atege umutego Yesu, aramubaza ati: “Mwigisha, nokora iki kugira ngo ndagwe ubugingo budashira?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ivyagezwe bivuga iki? Ubitahura gute?”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Aramwishura ati: “ ‘Ukundishe Uhoraho Imana yawe umutima wawe wose, umushaha wawe wose, inkomezi zawe zose n’ubwenge bwawe bwose’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Abalewi 19:18</ref></char></char></note>; kandi, ‘Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Gusubiramwo 6:5</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Wishuye neza. Genda ubigenze uko, uzobaho ibihe bidashira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ariko wa muntu agomvye kwisigura, aca abaza Yesu ati: “None mugenzanje ni nde?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Mu kumwishura, Yesu amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umuntu yariko aramanuka ava i Yerusalemu aja i Yeriko, hanyuma agwa mu maboko y’abambuzi. Bamwambura ivyo yari afise vyose, baramukubita, bamusiga ari hafi gupfa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Maze akirambaraye aho hantu, haca haza umuherezi yari amanukanye iyo nzira nyene. Amubonye, aca kure yiwe ku rundi ruhande rw’inzira, arirenganira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma haca Umulewi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Umulewi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">umukozi wo mu Ngoro y’Imana.</char></note> <char style="wj">na we nyene aramubona, ariko aca aca kure yiwe ku rundi ruhande rw’inzira, arireganira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><char style="wj">Ariko mu nyuma haza Umusamariya, ashika aho wa muntu arambaraye. Amubonye, amutera ikigongwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" /><char style="wj">Aca aramwegera, asomoza ibikomere vyiwe umuvinyu, abisiga amavuta ya elayo, hanyuma abipfukisha igitambara. Aca amushira ku ndogoba yiwe, amutwara mu nzu y’ingenzi, abandanya amwitaho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" /><char style="wj">Bukeye asokorora idenariyo zibiri azisigarana uwujejwe iyo nzu, amubwira ati: ‘Uwu muntu mumwiteho cane. Ninagaruka nzoriha ayo muzoba mwakoresheje arenga kuri aya.’</char><verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />
    <char style="wj">None muri abo bose, ni nde yabonetse nk’umugenzi w’uwo muntu yaguye mu bambuzi?”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Wa mwigisha w’ivyagezwe aramwishura ati: “Ni uwo yamugiriye impuhwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu aca aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Genda nawe ukore uko.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Marita na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Nuko Yesu n’abigishwa biwe babandanije urugendo, bashika mu mihana, ahaba umugore yitwa Marita, na we abaha ikaze iwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marita yari afise mwene nyina yitwa Mariya. Maze Mariya aragenda yicara imbere y’Umwami Yesu, yumviriza inyigisho ziwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ariko Marita we yari yatwawe n’ibikorwa vyinshi vyo gutegura inzimano. Nuko abaza Yesu ati: “Mwami, mbega nta co bikubwiye kubona mwene mama yantanye ibikorwa? Mubwire aze amfashe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ariko Umwami Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Marita, Marita, reka guhagarika umutima, wigora muri vyinshi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" /><char style="wj">Hari ikintu kimwe gusa ciza kuruta ibindi vyose. Mariya ni co yahisemwo, kandi ntazokwigera acakwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu yigisha intumwa gusenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Umusi umwe Yesu yari ahantu ariko arasenga. Ahejeje, umwe mu bigishwa biwe aramubwira ati: “Mwami, twigishe gusenga nk’uko Yohana yavyigishije abigishwa biwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mu gusenga mukwiye kuvuga muti:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">‘Data,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">izina ryawe niryubahwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Ubwami bwawe nibuze.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />
    <char style="wj">Uduhe ivyokurya bidukwiye ku musi ku musi.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />
    <char style="wj">Uduharire ivyaha vyacu,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">nk’uko natwe duharira umuntu wese aducumuyeko.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">Ntudutererane ibitugerageza.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yongera ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Dufate ko umwe muri mwebwe afise umugenzi, akaja iwe hagati mw’ijoro, akamubwira ati: ‘Mugenzi, ntabara ungurane imikate itatu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" /><char style="wj">Umwe mu bagenzi banje arangendeye ubu nyene, kandi singira ico ndamuzimana.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" /><char style="wj">Maze uwo mugenzi wiwe akamwishura ari mu nzu ati: ‘Nta co ungora, namaze kwugara umuryango kandi twe n’abana banje twamaze kuryama. Sinshobora rero kuvyurwa no kuguha imikate.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, naho atovyuka ngo amuhe iyo mikate kubera ari umugenzi wiwe, yovyuka akamuha ivyo akeneye vyose kubera yashishikaye kumugobera ata dusoni.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />
    <char style="wj">Ni co gituma nanje ndababwiye nti: ‘Musabe muzohabwa, murondere muzoronka, mudodore muzokwugururirwa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwusaba wese ahabwa, uwurondera aronka, n’uwudodora yugururirwa.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />
    <char style="wj">Ni nde muvyeyi muri mwebwe umwana yosaba ifi akamuha inzoka?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" /><char style="wj">Canke amusavye igi akamuha sikoropiyo?</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agakoko gakomoresha umurizo kandi gafise ubumara bukaze cane.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" /><char style="wj">Nimba mwebwe mushobora guha ingabire nziza abana banyu kandi muri babi mu mitima, mbega So wo mw’ijuru ntazorushiriza guha Mpwemu Yera abamumusavye?”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Umusi umwe Yesu yirukanye umudayimoni yari yateye umuntu kuba ikiragi. Amuvuyemwo, wa muntu aca aravuga, maze abantu baratangara cane. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ariko bamwe muri bo bavuga bati: “Ni Beyelizebuli, umukuru w’abadayimoni amushoboza kwirukana abadayimoni.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Abandi na bo bagerageza kugeza Yesu mu kumusaba ikimenyetso kivuye mw’ijuru.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu amenye ivyiyumviro vyabo, aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ubwami bwose bwiciyemwo ibice buba bugiye gusenyuka. Kandi iyo umuryango wiciyemwo ibice uba ugiye gusambuka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" /><char style="wj">Nimba Satani yigwanije, akicamwo ibice, none ubwami bwiwe bworama gute? Ibi ndabivuze kuko munyagiriza ko nirukana abadayimoni mu bushobozi bwa Beyelizebuli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" /><char style="wj">None nimba Beyelizebuli ari we anshoboza kwirukana abadayimoni, abigishwa banyu bo babishobozwa na nde? Ni co gituma ari bo bazobatsindisha.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" /><char style="wj">Ariko nimba ububasha bw’Imana ari bwo bunshoboza kwirukana abadayimoni, noneho Ubwami bw’Imana bwashitse muri mwebwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />
    <char style="wj">Iyo umuntu w’umunyenkomezi kandi afise ibigwanisho bikwiye araririye inzu yiwe, ivyo atunze biba mu mutekano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" /><char style="wj">Ariko iyo atewe n’uwumurusha inkomezi akamunesha, amwaka ivyo bigwanisho yari yizigiye, akamunyaga n’ivyo atunze, akabihako n’abandi.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <char style="wj">Uwutari kumwe nanje wese arangwanya, kandi uwutariko aramfasha kwegeranya wese, aba ariko arasanzaza.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />
    <char style="wj">Iyo impwemu ihumanye ivuye mu muntu, ica igenda iyerera mu bugaragwa irondera aho yoruhukira ariko ikahabura. Maze, ica ivuga iti: ‘Reka nisubirire muri ya nzu nahoramwo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Ishitse, iraheza igasanga ya nzu isukuye, kandi itunganije neza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" /><char style="wj">Maze ica igenda ikazana izindi mpwemu mbi indwi ziyirusha ububi, zikinjira muri wa muntu, zikibera ngaho. Ivya nyuma vy’uwo muntu biba bibi kurusha ivya mbere.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu akiriko aravuga ivyo, umugore yari ngaho avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Hahiriwe umuvyeyi yakuvyaye akakwonsa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ahubwo hahiriwe abumva ijambo ry’Imana bakarishira mu ngiro.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikimenyetso ca Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Abantu bamaze kumwegera ari benshi, Yesu ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Abantu ba kino gihe ni babi. Basaba ikimenyetso, ariko nta kindi kimenyetso bazohabwa kiretse ica Yona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Nk’uko Yona yabaye ikimenyetso ku bantu b’i Ninewe, ni ko n’Umwana w’Umuntu azoba ikimenyetso ku bantu ba kino gihe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><char style="wj">Ku musi wo guca imanza, umwamikazi w’i Sheba azohaguruka yagirize abantu ba kino gihe kandi abatsindishe, kuko yahagurutse akava ku mpera z’isi aje kwumviriza amajambo y’ubwenge ya Salomo; ariko raba uwuruta Salomo ari hano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><char style="wj">Ku musi wo guca imanza, abantu b’i Ninewe bazohaguruka bagirize abantu ba kino gihe kandi babatsindishe, kuko bo bihanye bamaze kwumva ubutumwa bwa Yona; ariko raba uwuruta Yona ari hano.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijisho ni itara ry’umubiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <char style="wj">Nta muntu yodomeka itara ngo aheze arihishe canke ngo aryubikeko igiseke. Ariko arishira ku giterekwako itara kugira ngo riboneshereze abinjira mu nzu bose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" /><char style="wj">Amaso yawe ni yo matara y’umubiri. Iyo amaso yawe abona neza, umubiri wawe wose uba mu muco. Ariko iyo abona nabi, umubiri wawe wose uba mu mwijima.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" /><char style="wj">None rero wiyubare umuco wibaza ko uri muri wewe ntusange ari umwijima.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" /><char style="wj">Vyongeye, umubiri wawe wose niwaba mu muco, ata rugingo na rumwe ruri mu mwijima, uzokayangana nk’aho urasiwe n’umuco w’itara.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahambarira Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu akiriko aravuga, umwe mu Bafarisayo aramutumira ngo bajane iwe amuzimane. Nuko ashitse, aja ku meza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Wa Mufarisayo aratangara cane abonye ko Yesu ariye adakaravye.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Maze Umwami Yesu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwebwe Abafarisayo mwitwararika cane kwoza igikombe n’isahani inyuma, ariko mwuzuye ubukunzi bw’inda n’ubugizi bwa nabi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" /><char style="wj">Mwa mburabwenge mwe! Mbega Imana yabumvye imbere si yo yabumvye n’inyuma?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero nimuhe aboro ku vyo mufise, maze ibindi vyose kuri mwebwe bizoba bihumanuwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <char style="wj">Muzobona ibara yemwe Bafarisayo, kuko mutanga ikigiracumi kuri vyose, gushika no ku mboga zo mu matongo yanyu, ariko mukirengagiza guca imanza zibereye, no gukunda Imana. Mwari mukwiye gutanga ico kigiracumi, n’ivyo bindi mutavyirengagije.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />
    <char style="wj">Muzobona ibara mwebwe Abafarisayo, kuko mukunda ivyicaro vy’icubahiro mu masinagogi no kuramutswa mu cubahiro mu makoraniro.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />
    <char style="wj">Muzobona ibara kuko mumeze nk’imva zitaboneka, abantu bakazicako batabizi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Umwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe aramubwira ati: “Mwigisha, erega uvuze uko natwe uba udututse!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Namwe bigisha b’ivyagezwe, muzobona ibara kuko muremereza abantu imitwaro iremereye, kandi ubwanyu mutanayikozako n’urutoke.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />
    <char style="wj">Muzobona ibara kuko mwubakira imva z’abavugishwa n’Imana, kandi ari ba sogokuruza banyu babishe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" /><char style="wj">Muri ivyabona kandi mwemeranya n’ivyo ba sogokuruza banyu bakoze; bo bishe abavugishwa n’Imana, namwe mukabubakira imva.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma Imana mu bwenge bwayo yavuze iti: ‘Nzobarungikira abavugishwa n’intumwa, bamwe muri bo bazobica, abandi babahame.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" /><char style="wj">None rero, abantu b’iki gihe muzoharurwako amaraso y’abavugishwa n’Imana bose yasheshwe kuva isi ikiremwa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><char style="wj">uhereye ku ya Abeli ugashitsa ku ya Zakariya yiciwe hagati y’igicaniro n’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Ndababwire ukuri, ingaruka z’ayo maraso yose zizoba ku bantu ba kino gihe.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />
    <char style="wj">Muzobona ibara yemwe bigisha b’ivyagezwe kuko mwatwaye urupfunguruzo rwo kumenya Imana. Mwebwe ubwanyu ntimwinjiye mu Bwami, ahubwo mwabujije n’abashaka kwinjira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca ava aho hantu. Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe baca batangura kumugwanya cane, bamubaza ibibazo ku bintu bitandukanye, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />kugira ngo barabe ko bomufatira ku vyo avuze.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu agabisha abantu yongera abatera intege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Muri ako kanya nyene, abantu ibihumbi n’ibihumbi bariko baragwirirana, gushika aho ata waronka aho ahonyora. Maze Yesu atangura kubigisha ahereye ku bigishwa biwe, abagabisha ati: <char style="wj">“Mwirinde umwambiro w’Abafarisayo, ari bwo buryarya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Nta cagizwe ibanga kitazomenyekana, kandi nta canyegejwe kitazoshirwa ahabona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Ivyo mwavugiye ahatabona bizokwumvikanira ahabona, kandi ivyo mwongoreraniye mu vyumba abantu bazobivugira hejuru ku mazu basemerera.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />
    <char style="wj">Bagenzi banje, umve ndababwire: ntimugatinye abica umubiri ariko inyuma y’ivyo ata kindi bashobora kubagira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Ariko ngira ndababwire uwo mukwiye gutinya: mutinye Imana yo ishobora kwica umubiri, ikagira n’ububasha bwo kuwuta mu muriro wa Gehinomu. Ndababwiye ukuri, abe ari yo mutinya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" /><char style="wj">Mbega utunyoni dutanu ntitugurwa ubusa bw’amahera? Ariko Imana ntiyibagira na kamwe muri two.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" /><char style="wj">Mbere n’imishatsi yo ku mitwe yanyu yaraharuwe yose. Nuko rero ntimutinye, kuko musumvya agaciro utunyoni twinshi.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese azonyemanga imbere y’abantu, Umwana w’Umuntu na we azomwemanga imbere y’abamarayika b’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" /><char style="wj">Ariko uwuzonyihakana imbere y’abantu, nanje nzomwihakana imbere y’abamarayika b’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" /><char style="wj">Kandi umuntu wese atuka Umwana w’Umuntu azobiharirwa, ariko uwutuka Mpwemu Yera ntazobiharirwa.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <char style="wj">Nibabashengeza mu masinagogi, imbere y’abatware n’abategetsi, ntimuze muhagarikwe imitima n’ivyo muzokwireguza canke muzovuga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" /><char style="wj">Mpwemu Yera azobigisha ivyo mukwiye kuvuga ako kanya nyene.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umutunzi w’igipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Umwe mu bari ngaho abwira Yesu ati: “Mwigisha, mbwirira uwo tuvukana yemere tugabure ivyo twarazwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ni nde yangize umucamanza wanyu n’umuhagarikizi wo kubagaburira ivyanyu?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mube maso, mwirinde guhahamira ivy’isi, kuko ubuzima bw’umuntu ntibuhagaze kw’itunga ryinshi afise.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Aca abacira umugani ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umugabo w’umutunzi yarimye itongo ryiwe aronka umwimbu mwinshi cane.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" /><char style="wj">Aribwira ati: ‘Mbega nkore iki ko mbuze aho nkwiza umwimbu wanje?’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />
    <char style="wj">Aca yigira inama ati: ‘Reka ndabigenze gutya: nsambure ibigega vyanje hanyuma nubake ibibiruta. Gutyo nzoronka aho mbika ingano zanje n’ubundi butunzi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma mpeze mbwire umutima wanje nti: “Mutima wanje, icara uruhuke, urye, unywe, unezerererwe ubuzima, kuko ufise ibizogutunga imyaka myinshi.” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko Imana iramubarira iti: ‘Wa gipfu we, iri joro nyene ubuzima bwawe urabwakwa. None ivyo waruhiye bizoba ivya nde?’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />
    <char style="wj">Uko ni ko bizogenda kuri abo bose biyegeraniriza ubutunzi bwabo ariko badatunze mu buryo bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntimukiganyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu aca abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Ni co gituma ndababwira nti: ntimukiganyire kubera ivyo mukeneye kugira ngo mubeho, vyaba ivyokurya canke ivyo kwambara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" /><char style="wj">Ubuzima buraruta cane ivyokurya, kandi umubiri uraruta cane ivyambarwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" /><char style="wj">Nimwitegereze ibikona: ntibibiba kandi ntivyimbura, ntibigira n’ububiko canke ibigega, ariko Imana irabigaburira. None mwebwe ntimuruta inyoni kure n’iyo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Ni nde muri mwebwe yoshobora kwiyongera akanya na gatoya ko kubaho kubera kwiganyira?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Nimba mutishoboza ikintu gito nk’ico, ni kuki mwiganyira ku bindi?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwitegereze ingene amashurwe yo ku misozi akura. Ntakora kandi ntajisha impuzu. Ariko ndababwira ko na Salomo ubwiwe mu cubahiro ciwe cose atigeze ashaza nka rimwe muri yo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" /><char style="wj">Nimba Imana yambika gutyo ivyatsi vyo ku misozi, biriho uno musi ariko ejo bikazotererwa mu ziko, mbega ntizorushirizaho kubambika, yemwe ab’ukwizera guke?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" /><char style="wj">Kandi ntimugashire umutima ku vyo muzorya canke muzonywa; ntimukiganyire kuri ivyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" /><char style="wj">Kuko n’abantu bo mu mahanga yose yo kw’isi na bo ivyo ni vyo birukira ubudasiba, ariko mweho So wo mw’ijuru arazi ko ivyo vyose mubikeneye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" /><char style="wj">Ahubwo nimubanze mwitwararike Ubwami bw’Imana, ivyo na vyo izobibaha nk’inyongera.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />
    <char style="wj">Yewe busho buto, ntutinye kuko So wo mw’ijuru bimuhimbara kuguha Ubwami.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" /><char style="wj">Nimugurishe ivyo mutunze, mubihe aboro. Mwironderere imifuko ibika amahera itazoshira, n’ubutunzi budahera bwo mw’ijuru, aho abasuma badashika, n’imiswa itazobwonona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" /><char style="wj">Kuko aho ubutunzi bwanyu buri ari ho imitima yanyu izoba.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwame mugavye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <char style="wj">Mwame mukenyeye kandi amatara yanyu yame yaka,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><char style="wj">mumere nk’abanyarugo barindiriye ko shebuja ava mu bukwe kugira ngo bace bamwugururira niyashika akadodora.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" /><char style="wj">Hahiriwe abo bakozi shebuja azosanga bagiteramye bamurindiriye. Ndababwije ukuri ko na we azokenyera akabicarika, hanyuma akabagaburira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" /><char style="wj">Hahiriwe abo bakozi shebuja azosanga bagiteramye bamurindiriye, naho yoza mu gicugu canke bugiye guca.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><char style="wj">Mutahure ibi: iyaba nyene inzu yomenye isaha igisuma kizirako, ntiyokwemera ko kimena inzu yiwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Namwe mukwiye kwama mugavye, kuko Umwana w’Umuntu azoza mu gihe mutamwiteze.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petero aramubaza ati: “Mwami, uwu mugani uwuciriye twebwe gusa, canke uwuciriye bose?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Umwami Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega umunyabigega w’umwizigirwa kandi w’umunyabwenge ni nde? Ni uwo shebuja ashobora guha ubukuru bwo kuganza abandi bakozi no kubagaburira mu gihe gikwiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" /><char style="wj">Azoba ahiriwe uwo mukozi shebuja azosanga akora gutyo niyagaruka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, azoshika amuzeza ivyo atunze vyose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" /><char style="wj">Ariko vyogenda gute hamwe uwo mukozi yokwibwira mu mutima ati: ‘Databuja yatevye kugaruka,’ hanyuma agatangura gukubita abandi bakozi, akirira, akinywera, akiborererwa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" /><char style="wj">Shebuja azoshika umusi uwo mukozi atari yiteze ko ashikirako, no kw’isaha atazi. Azomuhimbagura hanyuma amusangize ikibanza n’abatizera.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />
    <char style="wj">Uwo mukozi yari asanzwe azi ivyo shebuja agomba hanyuma ntavyitegurire ngo abikore, azohanwa bikomeye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" /><char style="wj">Ariko uwutazi ivyo shebuja agomba, hanyuma agakora ibitari vyo, azohanwa buhoro. Uwahawe vyinshi azosabwa vyinshi, kandi uwajwe vyinshi azobazwa vyinshi.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ko abantu bazocanamwo ku bwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />
    <char style="wj">Naje kwatsa umuriro kw’isi; ese iyo uba umaze kwaka!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><char style="wj">Hariho umubatizo w’imibabaro ntegerezwa kubatizwa, kandi urandemereye mu mutima kugeza ndawubatijwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" /><char style="wj">Mbega mwiyumvira ko naje ngo nzane amahoro kw’isi? Haba na mba! Ahubwo naje gutuma abantu bacanamwo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" /><char style="wj">Uhereye ubu, mu muryango w’abantu batanu bazocanamwo, batatu bagwanye babiri, babiri bagwanye batatu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><char style="wj">Umugabo azogwanya umuhungu wiwe, umuhungu na we agwanye se; umugore azogwanya umukobwa wiwe, umukobwa na we agwanye nyina; umugore azogwanya umukazana wiwe, umukazana na we agwanye inabukwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo gutahura ibihe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yongera abwira isinzi ry’abantu bari aho ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo mubonye igicu kivuye mu burengero, muca muvuga muti: ‘Imvura igira igwe,’ kandi biba uko nyene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" /><char style="wj">Mubonye umuyaga uhuhuse uva mu bumanuko, mukavuga muti: ‘Hagira haze ubushuhe,’ kandi bica biba uko nyene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" /><char style="wj">Mwa ndyarya mwe, ko mushobora gutahura ibimenyetso vy’ibihe murabiye ku biba kw’isi no kw’ijuru, ni igiki kibabuza gutahura ivy’iki gihe?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />
    <char style="wj">Ni kuki mudashobora guca urubanza, mugahitamwo ikibereye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" /><char style="wj">Nihagira umuntu aja kukwitwarira ku mucamanza, wihutire kwiyuzuza na we mutarashikayo. Ahandi ho, azogushikana imbere y’umucamanza, hanyuma na we agutange ku mukuru w’ibohero, maze na we agute mw’ibohero.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" /><char style="wj">Ndakubwire ukuri, ntuzovayo utarishe n’igiceri ca nyuma umuheraniye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nimutihana muzohona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Bamwe mu bari ngaho baca babwira Yesu inkuru y’abantu b’i Galilaya Pilato yishe akavanga amaraso yabo n’ay’ibimazi bariko baratanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mwibaza ko abo bantu b’i Galilaya bababajwe gutyo kubera bari abanyavyaha kurusha abandi Banyagalilaya?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" /><char style="wj">Haba na mba! Ariko nimutihana namwe muzohona nka bo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" /><char style="wj">Canke mwibaza ko bamwe cumi n’umunani bapfa igihe umunara wabagwako i Silowamu bari abanyavyaha kurusha abandi bantu bose baba i Yerusalemu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" /><char style="wj">Haba na mba! Ariko nimutihana namwe muzohona nka bo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Aca abacira uwu mugani ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu umwe yari afise igiti c’umusukoni giteye mu murima wiwe w’imizabibu. Umusi umwe aja kuraba ko hari icamwa yosangako, arabura.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Aca abarira umukozi yari ajejwe uwo murima ati: ‘Maze imyaka itatu nza kurondera ivyamwa kuri uwu musukoni, ariko singire ico ndonka. Giteme, kuko nta cotuma kibandanya conona isi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />
    <char style="wj">Wa mukozi aramubarira ati: ‘Databuja, cihanganire uwundi mwaka, ndakibagarire nongere ndagitabire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" /><char style="wj">Nicama bizoba ari vyiza, nikitama na ho uzoheza ugiteme.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umugore amugaye kw’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Umusi umwe Yesu yariko arigisha mw’isinagogi kandi hari kw’Isabato. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Aho hari umugore yari amaze imyaka cumi n’umunani amugajwe n’impwemu mbi. Yari yarahetamye umugongo, ntiyashobora kugororoka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu amubonye aca aramuhamagara ngo aze aho ari, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mupfasoni, ndakubohoye ubumuga bwawe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Aca amurambikako ibiganza. Ako kanya nyene, aca aragororoka, ahimbaza Imana.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ariko umukuru w’isinagogi ababazwa n’uko Yesu akijije umuntu ku musi w’Isabato. Aca abarira abantu bari aho ati: “Imisi y’ibikorwa ni itandatu. Muzohore muza gukizwa ingwara muri iyo misi, ariko atari ku musi w’Isabato.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Umwami Yesu aca arishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mwa ndyarya mwe! Ni nde muri mwebwe atozitura inka canke indogoba yiwe mu ruhongore ku musi w’Isabato ngo ayijane kunywa amazi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Mbega uwu mugore akaba n’umukobwa wa Aburahamu yari amaze imyaka cumi n’umunani aboshwe na Satani, ntiyari akwiye kubohorwa, naho ari ku musi w’Isabato?”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Avuze ivyo, abamugwanya bose baramaramara. Ariko abandi bose bari banezerejwe cane n’ibitangaza yariko arakora.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’akabuto gato n’umwambiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Nuko Yesu abandanya avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega Ubwami bw’Imana bumeze nk’iki? Nobugereranya n’iki?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" /><char style="wj">Bumeze nk’akabuto k’igiterwa citwa mutaride umuntu yateye mu murima wiwe, karakura gahinduka igiti, maze inyoni zo mu kirere ziraza zarika mu mashami yaco.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Ubwami bw’Imana nobugereranya n’iki?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" /><char style="wj">Bugereranywa n’umwambiro umugore akoresha mu gukora imikate. Naho yokoresha umwambiro muke mw’ifu ingana n’ingero zitatu,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 27.</char></note> <char style="wj">uwo mwambiro muke utuma igikandu cose c’umukate gikakama.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Irembo ryaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Nuko Yesu aca mu bisagara no mu mihana yigisha, yerekeye i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Umuntu umwe aramubaza ati: “Mwami, ubwo abakizwa ntibazoba bake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu aramwishura ati: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" /><char style="wj">“Mugire umwete wo guca mw’irembo ryaga, kuko ndababwire ukuri, benshi bazogerageza kwinjira ariko ntibabishobore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" /><char style="wj">Nyene inzu niyahaguruka akugara umuryango, muzohagarara inyuma mudodora, mutakamba muti: ‘Nyakwubahwa, twugururire.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">Na we azobishura ati: ‘Sindabazi kandi sinzi n’iyo muva.’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />
    <char style="wj">Namwe muzovuga muti: ‘Twarira kandi twanywera imbere yawe, mbere wigishiriza mu mabarabara y’iwacu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko azobishura ati: ‘Sindabazi kandi sinzi n’iyo muva. Mviraho mwa nkozi z’ibibi mwe!’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ni ho hazoba amarira no guhekenya amenyo, nimwabona Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo hamwe n’abavugishwa bose mu Bwami bw’Imana, namwe muterewe hanze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Abantu bazova mu buseruko no mu burengero, mu buraruko no mu bumanuko, bahabwe ivyicaro mu mazimano yo mu Bwami bw’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><char style="wj">Kandi mumenye ko hari bamwe mu bari inyuma bazoba ab’imbere, na bamwe mu bari imbere bazoba ab’inyuma.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aririra Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ico gihe, bamwe mu Bafarisayo baca baza aho Yesu ari, bamubwira bati: “Va ngaha ugende, kuko Herode Antipa agomba kukwica.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Genda mubwire iyo mbwebwe ko ndiko ndirukana abadayimoni nongera nkiza abagwaye uno musi n’ejo; ku musi ugira gatatu nzoba ndangije igikorwa canje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Uko biri kwose, ntegerezwa kubandanya urugendo rwanje uno musi n’ejo na hirya y’ejo, kuko nta handi umuvugishwa akwiye kwicirwa atari i Yerusalemu.</char><verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />
    <char style="wj">Yewe Yerusalemu, yewe Yerusalemu! Wewe wica abavugishwa n’Imana, ugatera amabuye abagutumweko. Ni kangahe nagerageje kwegeranya abana bawe nk’uko inkoko yegeraniriza imiswi yayo mu mababa yayo, ariko ukanyankira!</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><char style="wj">Kubw’ivyo, raba inzu yanyu igiye kuba akahebwe. Ndababwira ukuri ko mutazosubira kumbona kugeza aho muzovugira muti: ‘Hahezagirwe uwuje mw’izina ry’Uhoraho.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Zaburi 118:26</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza umuntu kw’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Umusi umwe, hari kw’Isabato, Yesu aja kuzimanwa mu nzu y’umwe mu bakuru b’Abafarisayo, kandi abari ngaho bose bari bamushinze ijisho. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Imbere yiwe hari umugabo agwaye ingwara yo kuvyimba umubiri. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu abaza Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega biremewe gukiza umuntu ku musi w’Isabato?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ariko ntibagira ico bamwishura. Maze Yesu aca amukorako, aramukiza, aramurungika arigira.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Aca ababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni nde muri mwebwe yoba afise umwana canke inka, uwo mwana aguye mu kinogo ntamukureyo; canke iyo nka iguye mu kinogo ntayikureyo, ngo ni uko ari ku musi w’Isabato?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Na ho nyene ntibashobora kuronka ico bamwishura.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu abonye ukuntu abatumire bahitamwo ivyicaro vy’imbere, aca abaha impanuro ati: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><char style="wj">“Nibagutumira mu musi mukuru w’ubukwe, ntuze uhitemwo icicaro c’imbere, kuko bishoboka ko hari uwugusumvya icubahiro nawe yatumiwe nkawe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" /><char style="wj">Muri ico gihe, nyene urubanza azoza akubwire ati: ‘Mubise yicare.’ Maze uzogenda uramaramara kwicara mu kibanza c’inyuma ya bose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" /><char style="wj">Ariko nibagutumira, uze uhitemwo icicaro c’inyuma kugira ngo nyene urubanza abe ari we aza akubwire ati: ‘Mugenzi, kaze mu cicaro c’imbere.’ Ico gihe uzoba utewe iteka imbere y’abandi batumire bose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><char style="wj">Kuko uwishira hejuru wese azocishwa bugufi, ariko uwicisha bugufi azoshirwa hejuru.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu aca abarira uwamutumiye ati: <char style="wj">“Niwategura umusi mukuru, ntuze utumire abagenzi, abavukanyi, incuti, canke ababanyi batunze. Kuko na bo bazogutumira, maze impera yawe ibe iyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" /><char style="wj">Ahubwo niwategura umusi mukuru, uze utumire abakene, abamugaye, abacumbagira n’abatabona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Aho ni ho uzohezagirwa. Kubera yuko badashobora kubikwishura, Imana izobiguhembera mw’izuka ry’abagororotsi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’abatumiwe ku musi mukuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Umwe mu bari ngaho ahejeje kwumva ayo majambo, aca abarira Yesu ati: “Hahiriwe uwuzofungura ku mazimano yo mu Bwami bw’Imana.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umuntu yateguye umusi mukuru, atumira abantu benshi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" /><char style="wj">Igihe co kuzimana kigeze, atuma umukozi wiwe kubwira abatumire ati: ‘Nimuze, vyose vyatunganye.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko bose baca batangura kwerekana ibibafatiriye bituma batagenda. Uwa mbere ati: ‘Unyihanganire, mpejeje kugura itongo, ngira nje kuriraba.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />
    <char style="wj">Uwundi na we ati: ‘Ndakwingize umbabarire, naguze inka cumi zirima, ngiye gusuzuma ko zikora neza.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />
    <char style="wj">Uwundi na we ati: ‘Sinshobora kuza kuko narongoye.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />
    <char style="wj">Wa mukozi aragaruka abwira shebuja ingene vyagenze. Maze na we arashavura cane, aca amubwira ati: ‘Genda mu mabarabara no mu mayira yo mu gisagara, uzane abakene, abacumbagira, abatabona, hamwe n’abamugaye.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />
    <char style="wj">Ahejeje kubikora, wa mukozi abwira shebuja ati: ‘Databuja, ivyo wantumye nabikoze, ariko haracasigaye ibibanza bigaragara.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />
    <char style="wj">Shebuja aramubarira ati: ‘Genda mu mayira y’inyuma y’igisagara no mu mirombero, winginge abantu ushimitse, baze kugira ngo inzu yanje yuzure.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, nta n’umwe mu bo nari natumiye ubwa mbere aja no kwumviriza ku mazimano yanje.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikiguzi co gukurikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Yesu ari mu nzira agenda, hari isinzi ry’abantu bari bamukurikiye. Maze Yesu, arahindukira ababwira ati: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><char style="wj">“Uwugomba kunkurikira ariko ntiyanke se, canke nyina, canke umugore wiwe, canke abana biwe, canke abo bavukana, ndetse n’ubuzima bwiwe na bwo nyene, ntashobora kuba umwigishwa wanje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><char style="wj">Kandi uwutikorera umusaraba wiwe ngo ankurikire, ntashobora kuba umwigishwa wanje.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ni nde muri mwebwe agomvye kwubaka igorofa, atobanza kwicara ngo aharure neza ko afise ivyo kuyuzuza?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" /><char style="wj">Kuko niyamara kwubaka umushinge hanyuma ntashobore kuyuzuza, abazoyibona bose bazomutwenga,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" /><char style="wj">bivugire bati: ‘Ehe, raba uwu muntu yatanguye kwubaka inzu ariko ntiyashobora kuyuzuza.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />
    <char style="wj">Canke, mbega umwami afise abasoda ibihumbi cumi atewe n’uwundi mwami afise abasoda ibihumbi mirongo ibiri, ntiyobanza kwicara akaraba neza ko yoshobora kugwanya uwo mwami amuteye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" /><char style="wj">Abonye ko adashobora kumugwanya, aca arungika intumwa ku wumuteye akiri kure, kugira ngo bamubaze ivyotuma babana amahoro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero, umuntu wese muri mwebwe adaheba ivyiwe vyose, ntashobora kuba umwigishwa wanje.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />
    <char style="wj">Umunyu ni ingirakamaro. Ariko iyo umaze gutakaza uburyohe bwawo, mbega bwosubiramwo gute?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" /><char style="wj">Nta co uba ukimaze, haba mw’ivu canke mu mase yo muri nyabarega; haba hasigaye ko utabwa hanze.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">
    <char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi yumva, niyumve!”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’intama yazimiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Umusi umwe abatozakori n’abanyavyaha bari bakikije Yesu bamwumviriza. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Maze ivyo bituma Abafarisayo n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe batangura kumwidodombera bavuga bati: “Uwu mugabo yicarana n’abanyavyaha, agasangira na bo!”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu aca abacira uwu mugani ati: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" /><char style="wj">“Hamwe muri mwebwe hoba hari uwufise intama ijana hanyuma imwe muri zo ikazimira, ntiyosiga izo mirongo icenda n’icenda mu gahinga, akaja kurondera iyo yazimiye gushika ayitoye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" /><char style="wj">Kandi ayitoye yoca ayiterera ku rutugu anezerewe</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" /><char style="wj">akayitwara i muhira, agahamagara ababanyi n’abagenzi akababwira ati: ‘Nimuze tunezeranwe kuko natoye intama yanje yari yazimiye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, no mw’ijuru haba umunezero mwinshi iyo umunyavyaha umwe yihanye gusumba uwo bagirira abagororotsi mirongo icenda n’icenda badakeneye kwihana.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’ihera ryatakaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />
    <char style="wj">Canke nk’umugore yoba afise ibiceri cumi vy’ifeza, hanyuma kimwe kigatakara, mbega ntiyokwatsa itara, agakubura inzu yose, akakirondera gushika agitoye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" /><char style="wj">Kandi agitoye yohamagara ababanyi n’abagenzi bose, akababwira ati: ‘Nimuze tunezeranwe kuko natoye igiceri canje c’ifeza cari catakaye.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" /><char style="wj">Ni ko n’abamarayika b’Imana bagira umunezero iyo umunyavyaha umwe yihanye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umwana w’icangazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu abandanya ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umugabo yari afise abahungu babiri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" /><char style="wj">Umusi umwe, umuhungu muto aritora abarira se ati: ‘Data, mpa umugabane w’ubutunzi norazwe.’ Nuko se abagaburira ubutunzi bwiwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />
    <char style="wj">Haciye imisi mike wa muhungu muto yegeranya ubutunzi bwiwe, aja mu gihugu ca kure, yonona ubwo butunzi bwiwe mu kuja mu buhumbu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" /><char style="wj">Amaze gusesagura bwa butunzi bwose, haca hatera amapfa muri ico gihugu, maze wa muhungu arakena.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" /><char style="wj">Nuko aja gushumbira umuntu wo muri ico gihugu, na we amurungika mu mirima yiwe kumuragirira ingurube.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" /><char style="wj">Uwo muhungu arasonza gushika aho yipfuza ivyokurya vy’ingurube, ariko na vyo nta n’umwe yabimuha.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko umusi umwe akenge karagaruka, aribwira ati: ‘Kwa data hari abakozi benshi kandi bararya bagasigaza, ariko jeho inzara igira inyicire hano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" /><char style="wj">Ngira mpaguruke nsubire kwa data ndamubwire nti: Data naracumuye ku Mana yo mw’ijuru, ncumura no kuri wewe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" /><char style="wj">Sinkibereye kwitwa umwana wawe; ntabara umfate nk’umwe mu bakozi bawe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" /><char style="wj">Nuko afata akayira aja kwa se.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <char style="wj">Akiri kure, se aramubona, afatwa n’ibigumbagumba, ariruka aja kumusanganira, aramugumbira, aramusomagura.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />
    <char style="wj">Wa muhungu abarira se ati: ‘Data, naracumuye ku Mana yo mw’ijuru, ncumura no kuri wewe. Sinkibereye kwitwa umwana wawe.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko se aca abarira abakozi biwe ati: ‘Nimwihute muzane ikanzu nziza iruta izindi muyimwambike, mumwambike n’impeta ku rutoke, n’ibirato ku birenge.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma muzane n’impfizi ivyibushe muyibage, turye, tunezerwe,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" /><char style="wj">kuko umwana wanje yari yarapfuye none arazutse, yari yarazimiye none arazimurutse.’ Nuko baca batangura kugira umusi mukuru.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />
    <char style="wj">Igihe ivyo vyaba, umuhungu mukuru yari mu mirima. Ariko arataha, yegereye i muhira, yumva abacuraranga n’abatamba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" /><char style="wj">Aca ahamagara umwe mu bakozi amubaza ibiriko biraba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" /><char style="wj">Aramwishura ati: ‘Wa muhungu muvukana yagarutse, so aca abaga impfizi ivyibushe, kuko yagarutse akiri muzima.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />
    <char style="wj">Wa muhungu mukuru aca arashavura, yanka no kwinjira mu nzu. Se aca arasohoka aja kumwinginga ngo yinjire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" /><char style="wj">Ariko uwo muhungu amwishura ati: ‘Data, raba iyi myaka yose maze ndagukorera, numvira amategeko yawe yose. Ntiwigeze umpa n’agasuguru k’impene kugira ngo nezeranwe n’abagenzi banje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" /><char style="wj">Ariko raba uwu muhungu wawe yononeye itunga ryawe ryose mu bamaraya, none aragarutse uca umubagira impfizi ivyibushe!’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />
    <char style="wj">Se amubwira ati: ‘Mwana wanje, wewe turamana imisi yose, kandi ivyo mfise vyose ni ivyawe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" /><char style="wj">Vyari bikwiye ko tugira umusi mukuru tukanezerwa kuko umuvukanyi wawe yari yarapfuye none akaba azutse, yari yarazimiye none akaba azimurutse.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umunyabigega asesagura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Inyuma y’aho Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umutunzi yari afise umunyabigega asesagura.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" /><char style="wj">Umusi umwe aramuhamagara, amubaza ati: ‘Ivyo ndakwumvako ni ibiki? Harura ivyo nakujeje ubinsubize, kuko ntukibereye kuzezwa ubutunzi bwanje.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />
    <char style="wj">Wa munyabigega aca aribaza ati: ‘Mbega ndabigenza gute ko databuja agira ankure mu kazi? Nta nkomezi mfise zo kurima, kandi gusega vyontera isoni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" /><char style="wj">Ndatoye ico ngiye gukora, kugira ngo ninava muri aka kazi, abantu bazompe indaro.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />
    <char style="wj">Maze ahamagara abo yahaye amadeni bose. Uwa mbere amubaza ati: ‘Databuja umuheraniye ibingana gute?’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />
    <char style="wj">Na we yishura ati: ‘Utugunguru ijana</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 3.000.</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">tw’amavuta ya elayo.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">
    <char style="wj">Wa munyabigega aca amubwira ati: ‘Akira urupapuro wandike utugunguru mirongo itanu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />
    <char style="wj">Abaza uwa kabiri na we ati: ‘Databuja umuheraniye ibingana gute?’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">Na we yishura ati: ‘Ingero ijana</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">16:7 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 30.</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">z’ingano.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">Aca amubwira ati: ‘Akira urupapuro wandike mirongo umunani.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />
    <char style="wj">Maze shebuja ashima urwenge uwo munyabigega asesagura yakoresheje. Ni ko n’abana b’iyi si bazi ubwenge bwo kwitunganiriza ivy’ubuzima kurusha abana b’umuco.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" /><char style="wj">Umve ndababwire: Ubutunzi bwanyu bwo mw’isi nimubukoreshe mu kwironderera abagenzi, kugira ngo nibwahera muzokwakirwe mu mazu y’ibihe bidashira.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />
    <char style="wj">Uwubaye umwizigirwa muri bike azozezwa vyinshi, kandi uwuzotakaza ubwizigirwa muri bike azobutakaza no muri vyinshi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" /><char style="wj">None mutabaye abizigirwa mu vy’ubutunzi bwa hano kw’isi, ni nde yobazeza ivy’ubutunzi nyakuri?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" /><char style="wj">Kandi mutabaye abizigirwa mu gutunganya ivy’ubutunzi bw’abandi, ni nde azobaha ubutunzi mwiganzira?</char><verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />
    <char style="wj">Nta mukozi n’umwe yoshobora gushimisha abakoresha babiri: agerageje kunezereza umwe, yosanga yababaje uwundi; kandi agerageje kuba umwizigirwa kuri umwe, yosanga yahemukiye uwundi. Ntimushobora gukoreshwa n’Imana ngo mwongere mukoreshwe n’amahera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Abafarisayo, kubera ko bakunda amahera cane, bumvise ivyo vyose baca baramutwenga. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Na we arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mwebwe mwigira abagororotsi mu maso y’abantu, ariko Imana irazi imitima yanyu. Kuko ivyo abantu baha agaciro kanini ari ibisesema imbere y’Imana.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izindi nyigisho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <char style="wj">Igihe c’ivyagezwe n’abavugishwa cagarukiye kuri Yohana. Kuva ico gihe, Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Ubwami bw’Imana buravugwa, kandi umuntu wese agerageza kugwana ngo abwinjiremwo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><char style="wj">Ariko biroroshe cane ko ijuru n’isi bikurwaho, hako agakwabu ko mu vyagezwe kokurwaho.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />
    <char style="wj">Umugabo yirukanye umugore wiwe hanyuma akarongora uwundi mugore aba asambanye, kandi umugabo arongoye umugore yahukanye, na we aba asambanye.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umutunzi n’umworo yitwa Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />
    <char style="wj">Habaye umutunzi yama yambaye mpuzu nziza z’igiciro kinini, kandi mu buzima bwiwe bwa misi yose yibera mu misi mikuru.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" /><char style="wj">Kw’irembo ryiwe hama haryamye umukene yitwa Lazaro, asega.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" /><char style="wj">Umubiri wiwe wari wuzuye ibikomere, akama yipfuza utwo kurya dukorotse tuva ku meza y’uwo mutunzi, mbere n’imbwa zama ziza kurigata ivyo bikomere vyiwe.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />
    <char style="wj">Igihe carageze uwo mworo arapfa, maze abamarayika baraza bamudugana mu gikiriza ca Aburahamu. Mu nyuma, wa mutunzi na we nyene arapfa, arahambwa,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" /><char style="wj">Ariko arababarizwa i kuzimu, yunamura amaso abona Aburahamu ari kure cane, na Lazaro ari mu gikiriza ciwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" /><char style="wj">Wa mutunzi arasemerera ati: ‘Data Aburahamu, ngirira ikigongwe, urungike Lazaro, akoze isonga ry’urutoke rwiwe mu mazi, ampfuvye ku rurimi kuko ndiko ndababarizwa cane muri uno muriro.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko Aburahamu aramwishura ati: ‘Mwana wanje, ibuka ingene mu buzima bwawe kw’isi waronse ivyo wipfuza vyose, Lazaro na we aba mu magorwa menshi. Ubu, ariko arahozwa amarira, na we uri mu mibabaro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" /><char style="wj">Kandi uretse n’ivyo, hagati yacu na wewe hari imanga nini ku buryo ata wushobora kuva ino ngo aze iyo, kandi ata n’uwushobora kuva hiyo ngo aze ino.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />
    <char style="wj">Wa mutunzi arishura ati: ‘Ndakwinginze data Aburahamu, rungika Lazaro agende mu muryango kwa data.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" /><char style="wj">Ndafise abo tuvukana batanu, nshaka ko agenda kubaburira kugira ngo na bo ntibazoze hano hantu ho kubabarizwa.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />
    <char style="wj">Aburahamu aramwishura ati: ‘Bafise ivyagezwe vya Mose n’ivyanditswe n’abavugishwa; nibabikurikize.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />
    <char style="wj">Wa mutunzi na we ati: ‘Oya data Aburahamu, ivyo ntibikwiye. Kumbure hagize uwugenda avuye mu bapfuye bokwihana.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko Aburahamu aramwishura ati: ‘Batumviye Mose n’abavugishwa n’Imana, nta wundi bokwumvira, n’aho yoba azutse mu bapfuye.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Inyigisho ku vyaha, ku kwizera no ku bikorwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Umusi umwe Yesu yabwiye abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Ibituma abantu bacumura ntibizoreka kuza, ariko umuntu abizana azobona ibara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" /><char style="wj">Ikimukwiye ni uko yoboherwa ibuye rinini kw’izosi, agatererwa mu kiyaga, hako acumuza n’umwe muri aba bato.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero mwiyubare mu vyo mukora.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">
    <char style="wj">Umuvukanyi wawe niyacumura, umwihanize. Niyihana, umuharire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" /><char style="wj">Niyagucumurako incuro indwi ku musi, akagaruka incuro indwi nyene akubwira ati: ‘Ndihanye mbabarira,’ uze umubabarire.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Intumwa zibwira Umwami Yesu ziti: “Mwigisha, twongerereze ukwizera.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Iyo muba mwari mufise ukwizera na gutoya kungana n’akabuto ka mutaride, mwobwiye iki giti muti ‘Randuka, ushingwe mu kiyaga,’ kandi cobumviye.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />
    <char style="wj">Ni nde muri mwebwe, afise umukozi, yohengera avuye kurima canke kuragira, akamubwira ati: ‘Kaze ku meza dufungure’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" /><char style="wj">Mbega ntaca avuga ati: ‘Ntegurira imfungurwa, hanyuma wambare neza ungaburire, ninaheza gufungura nawe uraheza ufungure’?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" /><char style="wj">Mbega arashimira uwo mukozi ko yakoze ivyo yamutegetse vyose? Haba na mba!</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero namwe nimwaheza gukora ivyo mwategetswe vyose, muze muvuge muti: ‘Turi abakozi b’imburakimazi, twakoze ivyo dutegerezwa gukora.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akiza abanyamibembe cumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu ariko araja i Yerusalemu, aca ku rubibe rwa Samariya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Agira ashikire imihana, haza abanyamibembe cumi baza guhura na we, ariko bahagarara kure yiwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Barasemerera bati: “Yesu, Mwigisha, tugirire impuhwe!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ababonye, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimugende, mwiyereke abaherezi.”</char> Bakiri mu nzira bagenda, baca barakira imibembe, barahumanuka.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Umwe muri bo abonye ko akize, aca asubira inyuma aja iyo Yesu ari, ashima Imana n’ijwi rirenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Amushikiriye, yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe, aramushimira. Kandi yari Umusamariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu arabaza ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega abakize bagahumanuka ntibari cumi? None abandi icenda bari he?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" /><char style="wj">Nta n’umwe yagarutse guha icubahiro Imana atari uwu munyamahanga?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Aca aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka wigire, ukwizera kwawe kwagukijije.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’ukuza kw’Ubwami bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Umusi umwe Abafarisayo babajije Yesu aho Ubwami bw’Imana buzozira, na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ubwami bw’Imana ntibuza mu buryo bubonwa n’amaso,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" /><char style="wj">kandi nta wuzovuga ngo: ‘Ehe buri hano’ canke ngo: ‘Ehe buri hariya.’ Kuko Ubwami bw’Imana buri hagati muri mwebwe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Aca abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Hazogera igihe mwipfuza kubona n’umusi umwe mu misi y’Umwana w’Umuntu, ariko ntimuzowubona.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" /><char style="wj">Abantu bazobabwira bati: ‘Ehe ari hariya!’ Canke ngo: ‘Ehe ari hano!’ Ntimuze mujeyo canke ngo mubakurikire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" /><char style="wj">Kuko nk’uko umuravyo uravya ukaboneshereza ijuru ryose, ni ko bizomera umusi Umwana w’Umuntu azoba aje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" /><char style="wj">Ariko azobanza kubabazwa cane no kwankwa n’abantu b’iki gihe.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />
    <char style="wj">Nk’uko vyari bimeze mu gihe ca Nowa, ni ko bizomera no mu gihe c’Umwana w’Umuntu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><char style="wj">Bararya, baranywa, bararongora, bagashingiza, gushika umusi Nowa yinjiye mu bwato, maze umwuzure ukaza ukabatikiza bose.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ni ko vyari bimeze no mu gihe ca Loti. Bararya, baranywa, barasuma, baradandaza, bararima, barubaka amazu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" /><char style="wj">gushika umusi Loti yaviriye i Sodomu, maze umuriro n’ibizuku bikoroka bivuye mw’ijuru, birabarigita bose.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />
    <char style="wj">Ni ko bizoba no ku musi Umwana w’Umuntu azohishurirwako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" /><char style="wj">Kuri uwo musi, uwuzoba ari hejuru ku nzu, ntazosubire mu nzu kurondera ivyiwe. N’uwuzoba ari mu murima, ntaze asubire i muhira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><char style="wj">Mwibuke ivyashikiye muka Loti.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><char style="wj">Uwugomba gukiza ubugingo bwiwe azobubura, ariko uwuzobuheba azobukiza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire, abantu babiri bazoba baryamye ku buriri bumwe, umwe azojanwa, uwundi asigare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" /><char style="wj">Abagore babiri bazoba bariko barasya bari hamwe, umwe azojanwa, uwundi asigare.</char> [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><char style="wj">Abagabo babiri bazoba bari kumwe mu murima, umwe azojanwa, uwundi asigare.”</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Maze abigishwa baramubaza bati: “None ivyo bizobera he ga Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Aho umuvyimba uzoba uri, ni ho ibisiga vy’amero bizokoranira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’umupfakazi n’umucamanza agabitanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu aca abacira umugani, kugira ngo abereke ko bakwiye kwama basenga, ntibadendebukirwe. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Mu gisagara kimwe habaye umucamanza atubaha Imana kandi ntiyumvire umuntu n’umwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" /><char style="wj">Muri ico gisagara nyene, hariho umupfakazi yama aza kumwinginga ati: ‘Ncira urubanza runkiza uwundenganya.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />
    <char style="wj">Uwo mucamanza amara igihe atamwumviriza. Ariko arateba aribwira ati: ‘N’aho ntantinya Imana kandi sinumvire n’abantu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" /><char style="wj">kubera uwu mupfakazi angoye cane; ngira ndamutunganirize kugira ngo ntabandanye aza kunduhisha.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Umwami Yesu yongerako ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwumve ivyo uwo mucamanza agabitanya yavuze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" /><char style="wj">Mbega Imana ntizotunganiriza abo yatoranije, bayitakambira ijoro n’umurango? Mbega mwibaza ko izobatevya?</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, izokwihuta kubatunganiriza. Ariko none, aho Umwana w’Umuntu azogarukira, azosanga ukwizera kw’isi?”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’Umufarisayo n’umutozakori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu arongera acira uwu mugani abantu bishimira ukugororoka kwabo bagakengera abandi, ati: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" /><char style="wj">“Abantu babiri baduze mu rusengero gusenga, umwe yari Umufarisayo uwundi akaba umutozakori.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" /><char style="wj">Wa Mufarisayo ahagarara ukwiwe, asenga avuga ati: ‘Mana ndagushima ko ntameze nk’abandi: abasuma, inkozi z’ikibi, abasambanyi, kandi simeze nk’urya mutozakori.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" /><char style="wj">Nisonzesha kabiri mu ndwi, kandi ntanga ikigiracumi c’ivyo ndonka vyose.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko wa mutozakori ahagarara kure, ntiyubahuka no kurangamiza mw’ijuru, yamara yikubita ku gikiriza, avuga ati: ‘Mana, ngirira imbabazi, jewe umunyavyaha.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, uwo mutozakori yatashe yemewe nk’umugororotsi imbere y’Imana, ariko kuri wa Mufarisayo si uko vyagenze. Kuko uwishira hejuru wese azocishwa bugufi, ariko uwicisha bugufi azoshirwa hejuru.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahezagira abana bato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Umusi umwe abavyeyi bazanye abana babo bato aho Yesu ari kugira ngo abakoreko. Ariko abigishwa barabakankamira. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ariko Yesu asaba ko babamuzanira, abwira abigishwa biwe ati: <char style="wj">“Nimureke abana bato baze aho ndi, ntimubabuze, kuko Ubwami bw’Imana ari ubw’abameze nka bo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, umuntu wese atakira Ubwami bw’Imana nk’umwana muto ntazokwigera abwinjiramwo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umutware w’umutunzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Umutware umwe aramubaza ati: “Mwigisha mwiza, nokora iki kugira ngo ndagwe ubugingo budashira?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Unyitira iki mwiza? Nta mwiza ariho, kiretse Imana yonyene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><char style="wj">Urazi ko amabwirizwa avuga ngo: ‘Ntugasambane, ntukice, ntukibe, ntukagirize abandi ibinyoma, wubahe so na nyoko.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kuvayo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Gusubiramwo 5:16-20</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Na we yishura ati: “Ayo yose nayakurikije kuva nkiri muto.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu yumvise iyo nyishu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Hari ikintu kimwe ugihajije. Genda ugurishe ivyo utunze vyose, maze amahera ukuyemwo uyahe aboro; ni ho uzoronka ubutunzi mw’ijuru. Hanyuma uce uza unkurikire.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Wa muntu avyumvise arababara cane kuko yari atunze cane. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu abonye ukuntu ababaye, aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Biragoye cane ko abatunzi binjira mu Bwami bw’Imana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" /><char style="wj">Vyokworoha ko ingamiya ica mu gatoboro k’urushinge rwo kubarira kurusha ko umutunzi yinjira mu Bwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Abavyumvise baramubaza bati: “None, nimba biri uko, ni nde ashobora gukizwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ibidashobokera abantu bishobokera Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Maze Petero aramubarira ati: “Twebwe twasize ivyacu vyose turagukurikira!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, nta muntu yasize inzu, canke umugore, canke abavukanyi, canke abavyeyi, canke abana kubera Ubwami bw’Imana,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" /><char style="wj">atazobishumbushwa incuro nyinshi muri iki gihe, kandi mu gihe kizoza akazoronka ubugingo budashira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yongera kuvuga ivy’urupfu rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Hanyuma Yesu aca yihereranya bamwe cumi na babiri, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ehe tugira tuduge i Yerusalemu, aho ivyanditswe n’abavugishwa n’Imana vyose ku Mwana w’Umuntu bizomushikako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" /><char style="wj">Azotangwa ahabwe abanyamahanga, bamucokore, bamutuke, bamucireko amate,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" /><char style="wj">bamukubite, hanyuma bamwice. Ariko ku musi ugira gatatu, azozuka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ariko abigishwa ntibigera batahura ikintu na kimwe mu vyo ababwiye. Insiguro yavyo yari ihishijwe, bituma badatahura ico ashatse kubabwira.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahumura impumyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu agira ashike i Yeriko, hari umuntu w’impumyi yari yicaye ku nzira asegerereza. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Yumvise abantu benshi bariko bararengana, abaza ibiriko biraba. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Na bo bamubwira bati: “Ni Yesu w’i Nazareti ariko ararengana.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Aca arasemerera ati: “Yesu, Mwana wa Dawidi, ngirira imbabazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abari imbere ya Yesu baramuzibiza ngo ahore, ariko arushiriza gusemerera ati: “Mwana wa Dawidi, ngirira imbabazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu aca arahagarara, asaba ko bamumuzanira. Amushikiriye, Yesu aramubaza ati: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" /><char style="wj">“Ushaka ko ndagukorera iki?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Na we arishura ati: “Mwami, ndashaka guhumuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Humuka, ukwizera kwawe kuragukijije.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ako kanya nyene aca arahumuka, akurikira Yesu ashima Imana. Abari aho bose babibonye bashima Imana.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Zakayo umutozakori yihana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Nuko Yesu yinjira mu gisagara ca Yeriko, ahaca arengana. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Muri ico gisagara hari umuntu yitwa Zakayo, yari umutozakori mukuru, kandi yari atunze cane. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Yashaka kubona Yesu, ariko ntivyakunda kuko hari isinzi ry’abantu, na we akaba ari mugufi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Nuko ariruka yurira igiti c’umusukomora cari i ruhande y’inzira, kuko ari ho Yesu yagira ace.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu ahashitse, ararangamiza, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Zakayo, ururuka ningoga, kuko uwu musi nyene nkwiye kurara iwawe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Nuko aca arururuka ningoga, amwakira iwe yuzuye umunezero.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ababibonye bose batangura kwidodomba bati: “Agiye kurara mu nzu y’umunyavyaha!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ariko Zakayo arahaguruka, abarira Umwami Yesu ati: “Mwami, ngira mfate ica kabiri c’ivyo ntunze ndakigaburire aboro, kandi nimba hari uwo nivye, ndabimuriha incuro zine.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu aca avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Uwu musi agakiza kinjiye muri iyi nzu, kuko uwu na we ni umwana wa Aburahamu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><char style="wj">Umwana w’Umuntu yazanywe no kurondera hamwe no gukiza abazimiye.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’ababikijwe mina cumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Bakiriko baramwumviriza, Yesu arabandanya abacira umugani, kuko yari yegereje gushika i Yerusalemu, kandi ico gihe abantu bibaza ko Ubwami bw’Imana buca bushika ubwo nyene. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Umuntu ava mu muryango wubashwe, yagiye mu gihugu ca kure kwimikwa, kugira ngo azogaruke yabaye umwami.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" /><char style="wj">Imbere yo kugenda akoranya icumi bo mu bakozi biwe, abaha mina</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero mina imwe yari n’impembo y’umukozi mu mezi atatu.</char></note> <char style="wj">cumi, ababwira ati: ‘Nimwakire aya mahera, mugende muyadandarishe gushika aho nzogarukira.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko abantu bo mu gihugu ciwe baramwanka, bituma barungika intumwa inyuma yiwe zija kuvuga ziti: ‘Uwo muntu ntidushaka ko aba umwami wacu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />
    <char style="wj">Amaze kwimikwa akaba umwami aragaruka. Aca atumako ba bakozi yaha amahera, kugira ngo arabe inyungu bungutse.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />
    <char style="wj">Uwa mbere araza, avuga ati: ‘Databuja, mina yawe yungutse izindi cumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />
    <char style="wj">Aca amubwira ati: ‘Wakoze neza, mukozi wanje mwiza. Ko wabaye umwizigirwa muri bike, ndaguhaye kuganza ibisagara cumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />
    <char style="wj">Uwa kabiri araza avuga ati: ‘Databuja, mina yawe yungutse izindi zitanu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />
    <char style="wj">Shebuja aramwishura ati: ‘Ndaguhaye kuganza ibisagara bitanu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko uwundi mukozi araza abwira shebuja ati: ‘Databuja, akira mina yawe; nayibitse mu gitambara ndayinyegeza kure.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" /><char style="wj">Naratinye kuko nzi ko uri umuntu agoye; wanura ivyo utanikiye, ukimbura ivyo utarimye.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />
    <char style="wj">Shebuja aramwishura ati: ‘Ngira ndagucire urubanza mfatiye ku vyo wivugiye wewe nyene, wa mukozi mubi we! Nimba wari uzi ko ndi umuntu agoye, nanura ivyo ntanikiye, nkimbura ivyo ntarimye,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" /><char style="wj">ni kuki utajanye amahera yanje ku bayadandarisha kugira ngo ngarutse ndonke umutahe wanje n’inyugu yawo?’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />
    <char style="wj">Nuko abwira abari bahagaze aho ati: ‘Nimumwake mina yiwe muyihe uwufise icumi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />
    <char style="wj">Baca bavuga bati ‘Databuja, erega asanzwe afise cumi!’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />
    <char style="wj">Na we arabishura ati: ‘Ndababwire ukuri, uwufise azokwongererezwa, uwudafise na we azokwakwa n’ivyo yari afise.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" /><char style="wj">Abo bansi banje na bo badashaka ko ndababera umwami, nimubazane hano mubicire imbere yanje.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yinjira i Yerusalemu nk’umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca arabandanya aduga i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Yegereje i Betifage n’i Betaniya ku Musozi wa Elayono, atuma babiri mu bigishwa biwe, ababwira ati: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" /><char style="wj">“Nimugende muri iriya mihana iri imbere yanyu; nimwashikayo murahasanga inyana y’indogoba iziritse ata muntu n’umwe arayigenderako. Muce muyizitura, muyizane hano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" /><char style="wj">Nihagira uwubabaza ati: ‘Ni kubera iki muyizituye?’ Mumwishure muti: ‘Umwami arayikeneye.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Nuko abatumwe baragenda, basanga ibintu bimeze nk’uko yari yabibabwiye. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Bakiriko barayizitura, nyeneyo arababaza ati: “Ni kuki muzitura iyo ndogoba?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Baramwishura bati: “Umwami arayikeneye.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Maze baca bayishira Yesu, bayisasako impuzu zabo, bayimwicarikako. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Kandi aho yaca hose, abantu baca basasa impuzu zabo mu nzira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yegereye ahari inzira imanuka iva ku Musozi wa Elayono, isinzi ry’abigishwa biwe batangura guhimbaza Imana n’akanyamuneza kenshi n’amajwi arenga, kubera ibitangaza vyinshi bari bamaze kubona, bavuga bati:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Hahezagirwe umwami aje mw’izina ry’Uhoraho!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Zaburi 118:26</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Amahoro abe mw’ijuru, n’icubahiro hejuru mw’ijuru!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bamwe mu Bafarisayo bari muri iryo sinzi babwira Yesu bati: “Mwigisha, hoza abo bigishwa bawe!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndababwire ukuri, naho bohora, amabuye yosemerera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yegereye Yerusalemu, yitegereza igisagara, arakiririra, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Ese icari kumpa, bicitwa uno musi ugashobora gutahuye, ivyerekeye amahoro yawe! Ariko noneho ivyo bihishijwe amaso yawe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" /><char style="wj">Kuko ntibigitevye ko abansi bawe baza bakakwubakira ibikwa vyo kwuririrako, maze bakagukikuza impande zose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" /><char style="wj">Bazogusambura gushika ku mushinge, bagutikizanye n’abana bawe bari muri mu mpome zawe. Ntibazosigaza ibuye na rimwe rigeretse ku rindi, kuko utigeze umenya igihe Imana yaza kukugendera.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahumanura urusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yinjiye mu rusengero, aca atangura kwirukana abariko bararudandarizamwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><char style="wj">Ababwira ati: “Handitswe ngo: ‘Inzu yanje izoba iyo gusengeramwo,’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yesaya 56:7</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">ariko mweho mwayihinduye ‘ubwihisho bw’ibisuma.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremiya 7:11</ref></char></char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Imisi yose Yesu yama yigishiriza mu rusengero. Ariko abaherezi bakurubakuru, abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abatware b’Abayuda bose baguma barondera ukuntu bomwica. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ariko ntibaronka aho bamuca kuko abantu bose bakunda cane kwumviriza inyigisho ziwe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Aho ububasha bwa Yesu buva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Umusi umwe Yesu yariko arigisha abantu mu rusengero, ababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza. Maze abaherezi bakurubakuru, abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abakuru b’Abayuda baza aho ari. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Baramubaza bati: “Ni ubuhe bubasha butuma ukora ivyo? Ni nde yabuguhaye?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Reka nanje mbanze ndababaze. Nimunyishure:</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" /><char style="wj">Mbega umubatizo wa Yohana wavuye mw’ijuru ku Mana canke ku bantu?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Baravugana hagati yabo bati: “Nitwavuga tuti: ‘Wavuye mw’ijuru,’ aca atubaza ati: ‘None ni kuki mutizeye ivyo Yohana yavuze?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nitwavuga tuti: ‘Ni ku bantu,’ abantu bose baradutera amabuye kuko bemera ata gukekeranya ko Yohana yari uwuvugishwa n’Imana.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Nuko baramwishura bati: “Ntituzi aho wavuye.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu na we aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nanje rero, sindababwira ububasha butuma nkora ibi aho buva.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugani w’uruzabibu n’abarukoramwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Hanyuma Yesu acira umugani abari ngaho, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Habaye umuntu yarimye uruzabibu, hanyuma aruzeza abarimyi, afata urugendo rwa kure, amarayo igihe kinini.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" /><char style="wj">Iyimbura rigeze, atuma umukozi wiwe kuri ba barimyi kugira ngo bamuhe igice c’umwimbu w’inzabibu kimwegukira. Ariko ba barimyi bafata uwo mukozi baramukubita, bamurungika iminwe misa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma arungika uwundi mukozi, na we nyene baramutuka, baramukubita, bamurungika iminwe misa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" /><char style="wj">Arungika n’uwa gatatu; we baramukomeretsa, bamuterera inyuma y’uruzabibu.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />
    <char style="wj">Nyene uruzabibu aribaza ati: ‘Mbega yemwe ngire gute? Reka ndungike umuhungu wanje nkunda cane, kumbure wewe bazomusonera.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ba barimyi bakimubona baca batangura kuvugana bati: ‘Uwu ni we azoba samuragwa. Reka tumwice kugira ngo twegukire ivyo yorazwe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" /><char style="wj">Nuko bamukwegera inyuma y’umurima w’uruzabibu bamwicirayo.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">
    <char style="wj">None mwibaza ko nyene uruzabibu niyaza azobagira gute?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" /><char style="wj">Azoza yice abo barimyi, maze urwo ruzabibu aruzeze abandi.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Abantu bavyumvise, baca bavuga bati: “Ikintu kibi nk’ico ntikikabe!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu arabitegereza, arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“None aya majambo yo mu Vyanditswe avuga ngo:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">‘Ibuye abubatsi bagaye</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">ni ryo ryahindutse irigumya imfuruka’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zaburi 118:22</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">asobanura iki?</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />
    <char style="wj">Umuntu wese azogwa kuri iryo buye azovunagurika, kandi uwo rizogwako rizomusya.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru barondera ingene bomufata ubwo nyene, kuko bari batahuye ko ari bo ariko aravuga muri uwo mugani, ariko batinya abantu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gutanga ikori rya Kayisari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Nuko batangura kumugenza, bahera abantu bigize abubaha Imana ngo bamutegere mu majambo avuga, kugira ngo baronke ivyo bamurega ku bategetsi b’Abaroma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Ba bantu babaza Yesu bati: “Mwigisha, turazi ko uvuga kandi wigisha ivy’ukuri. Nta ho uhengamira, kandi wigisha inzira y’Imana mu kuri kwose. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />None rero tubwire: mbega biremewe gutanga ikori rya Kayisari, canke ntivyemewe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu abonye ubugunge buri muri bo, aca ababwira ati: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" /><char style="wj">“Nimunyereke igiceri c’idenariyo. Iyi shusho n’ibi vyandiko biriko ni ivya nde?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Baramwishura bati: “Ni ivya Kayisari.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nuko rero, ivya Kayisari nimubihe Kayisari, ivy’Imana na vyo mubihe Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ntibabaye bakironka ingene bomufatira ku vyo avuga ku mugaragaro, ahubwo batangajwe n’inyishu yiwe, baca barahora.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’abagabo n’abagore inyuma y’izuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Maze bamwe mu Basadukayo, ari bo batemera ivy’izuka ry’abapfuye, baza aho Yesu ari baramubaza bati: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mwigisha, Mose yanditse avuga ko iyo umuntu apfuye agasiga umugore atagira abana, uwo bavukana ategerezwa kurongora uwo mupfakazi kugira ngo aronkere uruvyaro uwo muhisi. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Rero, harigeze kuba abavukana indwi. Mukuru muri bo ararongora, ariko apfa atavyaye. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Uwa kabiri aca arongora uwo mupfakazi, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />n’uwa gatatu bigenda uko, gushika no ku w’indwi bose biba nk’uko, bapfa ata wusize umwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Maze haheze igihe n’uwo mugore arapfa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />None ku musi w’izuka ry’abapfuye uwo mugore azoba uwa nde, ko yabaye umugore w’abo bahungu bose uko ari indwi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Abantu bo muri kino gihe bararongora kandi bararongorwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" /><char style="wj">Ariko abazoba babereye kuzuka mu bapfuye no kuba mw’isi nshasha ntibazorongora canke ngo barongorwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" /><char style="wj">Vyongeye ntibazoba bagipfa, kuko bazoba bameze nk’abamarayika. Bazoba ari abana b’Imana, kuko bazoba bazutse.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><char style="wj">Ku vyerekeye izuka ry’abapfuye, na Mose ubwiwe yaravyerekanye, igihe yavuga ivy’igisaka caka kidatemuka, akavuga ko Uhoraho ari Imana ya Aburahamu, ya Isaka na Yakobo.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kuvayo 3:6</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" /><char style="wj">Si Imana y’abapfuye, ni Imana y’abazima, kuko kuri yo bose bariho.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bamwe mu bigisha b’ivyagezwe barishura bati: “Uvuze neza, Mwigisha.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ntibabaye bacubahuka kumubaza ikibazo na kimwe.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni mwene nde?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kubera iki muvuga ngo Kristo ni mwene Dawidi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><char style="wj">Dawidi ubwiwe ni we yivugiye mu gitabu ca Zaburi ati:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Uhoraho yabariye Umwami wanje ati:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">“Icara i buryo bwanje</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="wj">kugeza abansi bawe bose</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">ndabashize musi y’ibirenge vyawe.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zaburi 110:1</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />
    <char style="wj">None nimba Dawidi amwita Umwami, yoba umwana wiwe gute?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwirinde abigisha b’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Yesu abwira abigishwa biwe, abari aho bose bumva, ati: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" /><char style="wj">“Mwirinde abigisha b’ivyagezwe. Bakunda kugendagenda bambaye amakanzu maremare y’icubahiro, no kuramutswa mu cubahiro mu makoraniro y’abantu. Bakunda kandi guhabwa ivyicaro vy’icubahiro mu masinagogi no mu misi mikuru y’amazimano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" /><char style="wj">Barya amazu y’abapfakazi bakabatwara ivyabo, kandi bakabandanya biyerekana nk’abantu beza mu gusenga amasengesho maremare. Ni co gituma bazohanwa kurusha abandi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Umupfakazi ashikanira Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu akiri mu rusengero, yunamura amaso abona abatunzi bashize amashikanwa yabo mu co bayatorezamwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Yongera abona n’umupfakazi na we ashizemwo ibiceri bibiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" /><char style="wj">Aca avuga ati: “Ndababwire ukuri, uwu mupfakazi w’umukene atanze vyinshi kurusha abandi bose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" /><char style="wj">Abandi bose batanze amashikanwa ku musesekara w’ubutunzi bwabo, ariko we, mu bukene bwiwe, atanze ivyomubeshejeho vyose.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibimenyetso vy’ibihe vya nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bamwe mu bigishwa batangura gushima ingene urusengero rwari rusharijwe n’amabuye meza cane hamwe n’ibindi vyashikaniwe Imana vyo kurushariza. Maze Yesu arababwira ati: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" /><char style="wj">“Ivyo vyose muriko murabona, igihe kizoza aho ata buye na rimwe rizosigara rigeretse ku rindi; yose azosamburirwa hasi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Baca baramubaza bati: “Mwigisha, ivyo bizoshika ryari? Ni ikihe kimenyetso kizokwerekana ko bigiye gushika?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mwiyubare ntihagire umuntu n’umwe abazimiza. Kuko benshi bazoza biyita izina ryanje, bavuga ngo: ‘Ni jewe Kristo,’ kandi ngo: ‘Igihe kirashitse.’ Ntimuze mubakurikire.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" /><char style="wj">Nimwumva intambara n’imigumuko, ntimuze muhagarike imitima yanyu. Ivyo bitegerezwa kubanza gushika, ariko iherezo rya vyose ntirizoba rirashika.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yongera ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ihanga rizotera irindi hanga, ubwami butere ubundi bwami.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" /><char style="wj">Hazoba ukunyiganyiga kw’isi gukomeye kandi guteye ubwoba; hazotera amapfa n’ingwara z’ivyaduka mu bice vy’isi bitandukanye. Hazoba ibiteye ubwoba n’ibimenyetso bihambaye biva mw’ijuru.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ivyo bitarashika, bazobahama, babafate, babatware mu masinagogi no mu mabohero, babarengutse imbere y’abami n’abatware babahora izina ryanje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" /><char style="wj">Ako kazoba ari akaryo ko kunshingira intahe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><char style="wj">Ariko ntimuze muhagarikwe imitima n’ivyo muzokwireguza,</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><char style="wj">kuko nzobaha amajambo n’ubwenge bizotuma abababuranya badashobora kubahaririza canke ngo babahinyuze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" /><char style="wj">Mbere n’abavyeyi banyu, abo muvukana, incuti n’abagenzi bazobahemukira, kandi bazokwica bamwe muri mwebwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" /><char style="wj">Abantu bose bazobanka babahora izina ryanje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" /><char style="wj">Ariko nta n’agashatsi ko ku mitwe yanyu kazotakara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" /><char style="wj">Nimwihangana, muzorokora ubugingo bwanyu.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />
    <char style="wj">Nimwabona i Yerusalemu hakikujwe n’ingabo, muzoce mumenya ko isenyurwa ryaho ryegereje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" /><char style="wj">Nuko abazoba bari i Yudaya baze bahungire ku misozi, abari mu gisagara bakivemwo, kandi abazoba bagiye mu misozi, ntibaze bagaruke mu gisagara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><char style="wj">Kuko iyo misi izoba ari iy’ukwihora kw’Imana, kugira ngo Ivyanditswe bishike.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" /><char style="wj">Ese ukuntu iyo misi izoba ari iy’umubabaro utagira uko ungana ku bagore bibungenze n’abazoba bonsa! Kizoba ari igihe c’umubabaro mwinshi mu gihugu, n’uburake bw’Imana kuri ubu bwoko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" /><char style="wj">Benshi muri bo bazokwicishwa inkota, canke batwarwe nk’inyagano mu mahanga yose yo kw’isi. Igisagara ca Yerusalemu kizohonyangwa n’abanyamahanga kugeza igihe abanyamahanga bagenewe kirangiye.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <char style="wj">Hazoba ibimenyetso ku zuba, ku kwezi no ku nyenyeri. Kw’isi na ho, amahanga azogira ubwoba abure uko agira, kubera ukubomborana kw’amazi yo mu biyaga hamwe n’imipfunda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" /><char style="wj">Imitima y’abantu izohagarara bishwe n’ubwoba, babonye ibigira bishike kw’isi, kuko ivy’inkomezi biri mu kirere bizonyiganyizwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><char style="wj">Inyuma y’ivyo, umuntu wese azobona Umwana w’Umuntu azananye n’ibicu, afise ububasha n’ubwiza bwinshi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" /><char style="wj">Nimwabona ivyo bibaye, muze muhaguruke, murangamize kuko ugucungurwa kwanyu kuzoba kwegereje.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Nuko Yesu abacira umugani ati: <char style="wj">“Nimurabire ku giti c’umusukoni canke ku kindi giti ico ari co cose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" /><char style="wj">Iyo bizanye amababi, muca mumenya ko agatasi kari hafi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" /><char style="wj">None rero nimwabona ivyo vyose, muzoce mumenya neza ko Ubwami bw’Imana buri hafi.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />
    <char style="wj">Ndababwire ukuri, abo muri runo runganwe ntibazopfa bose ivyo vyose bitarashika.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" /><char style="wj">Ijuru n’isi bizokurwaho, ariko amajambo yanje ntazovaho.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />
    <char style="wj">Mwiyubare, imitima yanyu ntiremerwe n’akaborerwe hamwe n’ibihimbaro bijanye na ko, canke imyitwarariko y’ivy’ubu buzima, kugira ngo uwo musi ntuze ubashikeko giturumbuka,</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" /><char style="wj">kuko uko ari ko uzoshika ku bari kw’isi bose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" /><char style="wj">Nuko rero mwame maso, musenge kugira ngo muze muronke inkomezi zibashoboza kurengana ivyo vyose, no kugira ngo muze mushobore guhagarara imbere y’Umwana w’Umuntu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Imisi yose Yesu yama yigishiriza mu rusengero, ku mugoroba akava mu gisagara akaja kurara ku Musozi wa Elayono, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />kandi abantu benshi bama baza mu gatondo mu rusengero kumwumviriza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda agurisha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Umusi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro, ari wo musi wa Pasika wegereje, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bariko barondera akaryo ko kwica Yesu, ariko bagatinya abantu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Nuko Satani yinjira muri Yuda Isikariyote, umwe muri bamwe cumi na babiri, <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />na we aca aja ku baherezi bakurubakuru hamwe n’abakuru b’abarinzi b’urusengero ngo bavugane ingene yobashikiriza Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Na bo baranezerwa cane, baca bumvikana kumuha amahera. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda na we aravyemera, maze aca atangura kurondera akaryo keza ko kumubashikiriza ata bantu benshi bahari.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bategura ivyokurya vya Pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Maze umusi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro urashika, kandi kuri uwo musi bategerezwa gutanga ikimazi c’umwagazi w’intama wa Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu abarira Petero na Yohana ati: <char style="wj">“Nimugende mudutegurire ivyokurya vya Pasika.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Baramubaza bati: “Ni hehe ugomba ko tubitegurira?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Mucinjira mu gisagara, muraja guhura n’umuntu yikoreye umubindi w’amazi. Muce mumukurikira gushika mu nzu aja kwinjiramwo,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" /><char style="wj">hanyuma mubwire nyene urugo muti: ‘Umwigisha ashaka kumenya ahari icumba c’abashitsi aja gusangiriramwo ivya Pasika n’abigishwa biwe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" /><char style="wj">Na we araja kubereka icumba kinini co hejuru, kirimwo ibikenewe vyose. Aho abe ari ho mubitegurira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nuko baragenda basanga bimeze nk’uko yabibabwiye, maze bategura ivyokurya vya Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Isaha ishitse, Yesu n’intumwa ziwe baca baricarana ku meza. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nari naripfuje cane gusangira namwe iyi Pasika imbere y’uko mbabazwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" /><char style="wj">Kuko ndabamenyesheje ko ntazosubira kurya iyindi Pasika, kugeza igihe insiguro yayo izoba ishitsweko mu Bwami bw’Imana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nuko afata igikombe, agishimira Imana, ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimwakire munywe mwese.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" /><char style="wj">Kuko ndababwire, sinzosubira kunywa ku muvinyu w’imizabibu, gushika aho Ubwami bw’Imana buzozira.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Aca afata n’umukate, awushimira Imana, arawumanyura, arawubahereza avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Iki ni ikimenyetso c’umubiri wanje utanzwe ku bwanyu; muzohore mubikora mu kunyibuka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Bahejeje gufungura, agira uko nyene, afata igikombe, avuga ati: <char style="wj">“Iki gikombe ni isezerano</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isezerano </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hagati y’Imana n’abantu bayo.</char></note> <char style="wj">rishasha rivuye mu maraso yanje, asesetse ku bwanyu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" /><char style="wj">Kandi ehe raba uwugira angurishe twicaranye hano dusangira.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="wj">Umwana w’Umuntu agiye gupfa nk’uko vyanditswe, ariko aragowe uwo muntu amugurishije.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Baca batangura kubazanya hagati muri bo uwokwubahuka gukora ivyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Maze haduka impari hagati yabo, bagomba kumenya umukuru muri bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Abami b’Abanyamahanga babatwaza umukazo, kandi ababafiseko ububasha bose bashaka kwitwa abagiraneza.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><char style="wj">Ariko ntimukwiye kumera gutyo. Ahubwo umukuru muri mwebwe namere nka mutoya muri mwebwe, kandi umutware amere nk’umukozi wanyu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><char style="wj">Mbega hagati y’uwuri ku meza afungura n’umukozi amutegurira imfungurwa ni nde mukuru? Mbega si uwuri ku meza? Ariko jewe ndi hano muri mwebwe nk’uwubakorera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" /><char style="wj">Mwebwe muri bamwe bagumanye nanje mu bihe vyo kugeragezwa kwanje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" /><char style="wj">Nanje ndabahaye Ubwami nk’uko Data yabumpaye nanje,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><char style="wj">kugira ngo muze murire mwongere munywere ku meza yanje mu Bwami bwanje, kandi muze mwicare ku ntebe z’icubahiro mucire imanza imiryango cumi n’ibiri y’Abisirayeli.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu avuga ko Petero ahava amwihakana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Nuko abwira Petero ati: <char style="wj">“Simoni, Simoni, umviriza! Satani yabasavye kugira ngo abagosore nk’uko bagosora ingano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><char style="wj">Ariko wewe nagusengeye kugira ngo ntutakaze ukwizera, kandi niwamara kwihana ukangarukako uze ukomeze bene So.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petero aramwishura ati: “Mwami, nditeguye kujana nawe no gushika mw’ibohero, mbere no gupfana nawe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Petero, ndakubwire ukuri, isake itarabika uzoba umaze kunyihakana gatatu kose uvuga ko utanzi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu aca arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Igihe nabarungika ata saho, ata mufuko canke ibirato, hari ico mwakenye?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Baramwishura bati: “Nta na kimwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Aca arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Ubu rero uwufise amahera mu mufuko nayibangikanye, uwufise isakoshi ayitore, kandi n’uwudafise inkota agurishe umutamana wiwe ayigure.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><char style="wj">Ndababwire, iri jambo ryavugishijwe kuri jewe ngo: ‘Yafashwe nk’umwe mu bagarariji,’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Yesaya 53:12</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">ritegerezwa gushika. Ni ukuri, ivyanditswe kuri jewe vyose bigira bishike.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Abigishwa biwe baramubwira bati: “Mwami, ehe turafise inkota zibiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Izo ziramaze.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asengera ku Musozi wa Elayono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Hanyuma Yesu aca ajana n’abigishwa biwe ku Musozi wa Elayono nk’uko yari asanzwe abigenza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Bashitseho, Yesu arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Nimusenge kugira ngo ntimutsindwe n’ibibagerageza.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Aca yigira kure gato nk’aho umuntu yotera ibuye, arapfukama arasenga ati: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" /><char style="wj">“Data, ubigomvye, ndakwinginze unkure imbere iki gikombe c’imibabaro. Ariko ntibibe nk’uko jewe ngomba, yamara bibe uko wewe ugomba.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Maze umumarayika aramwiyereka avuye mw’ijuru, amwongera inkomezi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Nuko arasenga cane, yuzuye umubabaro mwinshi, icuya ciwe gicika nk’amama y’amaraso atonyangira hasi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Yunamutse ahejeje gusenga, asubira aho ba bigishwa biwe bari bari, asanga basinziriye, baremerewe n’umubabaro. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki musinziriye? Nimuvyuke, musenge kugira ngo ntimutsindwe n’ibibagerageza.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu akiriko aravuga, haca haza abantu benshi, barongowe na Yuda, umwe muri ba bigishwa cumi na babiri. Nuko yegera Yesu, aramusoma. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu aca amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Yuda, ugurishije Umwana w’Umuntu mu kumusoma?”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Abigishwa ba Yesu babonye ibigira bibe baramubaza bati: “Mwami, tubivune na za nkota?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Umwe muri bo aca akubita inkota umukozi w’umuherezi mukuru, amuca ugutwi kw’i buryo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yesu aca arasemerera ati: <char style="wj">“Geza aho, biramaze!”</char> Maze aca akora kuri ukwo gutwi, aramukiza.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu aca abwira abaherezi bakurubakuru, abarinzi b’urusengero n’abatware bari baje kumufata, ati: <char style="wj">“Mbega mbaye umugumutsi, aho muza kumfata mwitwaje inkota n’amahiri?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><char style="wj">Imisi yose namana namwe mu rusengero, ntimwigeze mumfata. Ariko noneho igihe canyu ni iki; umwijima ugira uganze.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero yihakana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Nuko baramufata bamutwara mu rugo rw’umuherezi mukuru. Petero na we arabakurikira agendera kure inyuma yabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ariko bamaze gushika mu rugo bagacana umuriro bakicara, Petero na we yaciye yicarana na bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Maze umwigeme umwe akora ngaho aramubona ariko arota umucanwa. Aramwihweza, aca avuga ati: “Uwu mugabo yari kumwe na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ariko arabihakana, abwira uwo mugore ati: “Haba na mba, sindanamuzi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Haciye akanya, uwundi muntu aramubona, avuga ati: “Na wewe uri umwe muri bo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Petero yishura uwo muntu ati: “Eka sindi kumwe na bo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Haciye nk’isaha, uwundi muntu arabishimangira ati: “Ni ivy’ukuri uwu yari kumwe na Yesu, kuko ni Umunyagalilaya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petero yishura uwo muntu ati: “Sinzi n’ivyo uriko uravuga.” Akiriko aravuga, isake ica irabika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Umwami Yesu aca arahindukira, araba Petero mu maso. Petero na we aca yibuka ya majambo Yesu yari yamubwiye ati: <char style="wj">“Uno musi nyene, isake itarabika, uza kuba umaze kunyihakana gatatu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petero aca asohoka hanze, araturikisha ararira.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abarinzi b’urusengero bacokora Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Maze abagabo bari bamurinze batangura kumucokora no kumukubita. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamupfunga igitambara mu maso, bamubwira bati: “Vugishwa! Ni nde agukubise?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bongera bamubwira n’ayandi majambo menshi yo kumutuka.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ajanwa kwa Pilato no kwa Herode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bukeye, inama nkuru y’abatwara ubwo bwoko irakorana, irimwo abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe, maze Yesu ajanwa imbere yabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Baramubaza bati: “Tubwire! Uri Kristo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Naho nobibabwira ntimwovyemera,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" /><char style="wj">kandi nobabaza ikibazo ntimwonyishura.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" /><char style="wj">Ariko kuva ubu Umwana w’Umuntu agiye kwicara i buryo bw’Inyenkomezi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bose baramubaza bati: “Ugomvye kuvuga rero ko uri Umwana w’Imana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Na we arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Muravyivugiye ko ndi we.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Baca bavuga bati: “None hari ibindi vyabona dukeneye? Ntituvyiyumviye bimwiviriye mu kanwa?”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nuko abari mu nama bose bavira hasi rimwe bamujana kwa Pilato, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />batangura kumurega bavuga bati: “Uwu muntu twasanze ariko aragumura abantu bo mu bwoko bwacu, ababuza gutanga ikori rya Kayisari, kandi yigira Kristo, umwami.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato aca abaza Yesu ati: “Woba uri umwami w’Abayuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Uvuze ukuri, ndi we.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato aca abarira abaherezi bakurubakuru n’isinzi ry’abantu bari ngaho bose ati: “Uwu muntu simbona ikimwagira.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ariko barushiriza kuvuga bati: “Agumura abantu i Yudaya hose biciye mu nyigisho ziwe. Yatanguriye i Galilaya none raba ashitse n’ino i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato avyumvise aca abaza ati: “Uwu muntu ava i Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Maze amenye ko Yesu atwarwa mu ntara ya Herode Antipa, aca aramumurungikira, kandi ico gihe Herode yari i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herode abonye Yesu, aranezerwa cane kuko yari amaze igihe kirekire yipfuza kumubona. Yari yarumvise ivyiwe, maze yipfuza kumubona ngo akore igitangaza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nuko abaza Yesu ibibazo vyinshi ariko ntiyishura na kimwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bari bahagaze ngaho, bamwagiriza bashimitse. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herode n’abasoda biwe baca batangura kumushinyagurira no kumucokora. Baca bamwambika impuzu y’ubwami, baramurungika asubira kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kuva uwo musi Herode na Pilato baca baba abagenzi, kuko imbere y’aho bari abansi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato aca akoranya abaherezi bakurubakuru, abatware n’abari ngaho bose, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ababwira ati: “Mwanzaniye uwu muntu muvuga ko yateye imigumuko, ariko namusambishirije imbere yanyu, nta caha camwagiriye. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ndetse na Herode nta co yamwagirije kuko mwiboneye ko yamudusubije. Nta co yakoze cotuma yicwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ndamukubitisha gusa, hanyuma ndamurekure.” [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Igihe cose kuri Pasika, Pilato yama abarekurira imbohe imwe.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ariko bose basemerera icarimwe bati “Uwo muntu nabambwe, uturekurire Baraba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Uwo Baraba yari yatawe mw’ibohero yagirizwa ubwicanyi hamwe n’umugumuko wari wabaye mu gisagara.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Kubera ko Pilato yagomba kurekura Yesu, yongera avugana n’iryo sinzi ry’abantu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ariko bo barushiriza gusemerera bati: “Nabambwe! Nabambwe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Yongera kubabaza ubwa gatatu ati: “None ni ikihe caha yakoze? Nta kintu na kimwe nabonye yakoze cotuma yicwa. Ariko ndamutanga bamutonagure gusa, hanyuma ndamurekure.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Noneho baca bashira urwamo hejuru basaba ko Yesu abambwa, gushika aho Pilato arengerwa, <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />aca abemerera ico bamusavye. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nuko arekura wa mugabo yari apfunzwe yagirizwa imigumuko n’ubwicanyi, uwo bari basavye ko yobarekurira, hanyuma abaha Yesu ngo bamukoze ico bashaka.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Abasoda batwaye Yesu kumubamba bafata Simoni w’i Kurene, yari avuye mu mirima, baca bamukorera umusaraba, agendera inyuma ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Maze abantu isinzi baramukurikira, harimwo n’abagore bagenda baramuririra baboroga. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu arahindukira arababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Bakobwa b’i Yerusalemu, nta co mundirira. Nimwiririre mwebwe, muririre n’abana banyu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" /><char style="wj">Kuko igihe kigiye gushika, aho abantu bazovuga bati: ‘Hahiriwe abagore batigeze bavyara, n’inda zitigeze zibungenga, hamwe n’amabere atigeze yonsa.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><char style="wj">Hanyuma</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">‘bazobwira imisozi bati: “Tugweko!”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hoseya 10:8</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">n’imitumba bati: “Tunyegeze!” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />
    <char style="wj">Kuko nimba bagiriye gutya igiti kibisi, mbega icumye co bizokigendera gute?”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kandi hariho n’abandi bagabo babiri b’inkozi z’ikibi, na bo bajanwa kwicirwa hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Babashikanye ahantu hitwa Nyagihanga, abasoda baca baramubamba, ari kumwe na za nkozi z’ikibi, umwe i buryo uwundi i bubamfu bwiwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Maze Yesu aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Data, bababarire, kuko ntibazi ico bariko barakora.”</char> Maze bagabura impuzu ziwe bakoresheje ubupfindo.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Abantu isinzi bari aho babiraba; abakuru b’Abayuda na bo bamucokora, bavuga bati: “Yakijije abandi, niyikize na we turabe, ko yigira ngo ni Kristo, Uwatoranijwe n’Imana.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />N’abasoda baraza baramushinyagurira, bamuha inkarisha kugira ngo anywe, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />bamubwira bati: “Nimba uri umwami w’Abayuda, niwikize turabe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Baca bamanika icandiko hejuru yiwe kivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">
    <char style="sc">Uwu ni umwami w’Abayuda.</char><verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Umwe muri za nkozi z’ikibi zibambanywe na we aramutuka ati: “Ko uri Kristo, niwikize hanyuma natwe udukize.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ariko mugenziwe aramukankamira avuga ati: “Mbega wewe ntutinya n’Imana kandi waciriwe urubanza rumwe n’urwiwe? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Twebwe twahaniwe ikiri ukuri, kuko turiko twishura ibihwanye n’ivyo twakoze. Ariko uwu we nta kibi na kimwe yakoze.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Aca avuga ati: “Yesu, uranyibuka niwagaruka mu Bwami bwawe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu aramwishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ndakubwire ukuri, uno musi nyene uraza kubana nanje muri paradizo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Hari nk’isaha zitandatu z’umurango, maze umwijima utwikira igihugu cose gushika isaha icenda, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />kuko izuba ryari ryazimye. Maze igitambara co mu rusengero na co gitabukamwo kubiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu aca arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: <char style="wj">“Data, mu biganza vyawe ni ho nshize impwemu yanje.”</char> Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aracikana.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Intwazangabo y’Umuroma yari aho abonye ibibaye, aca ashima Imana avuga ati: “Ni ukuri, uwu muntu yari umugororotsi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Rya sinzi ry’abantu bari bakoraniye aho baje gushengerera ibiriko biraba babonye ibibaye, basubira inyuma buzuye umubabaro, bishishitira. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ariko abari bazi Yesu, harimwo na ba bagore bari bamukurikiye kuva i Galilaya, bagumye bahagaze aho barabira kure ivyariko biraba.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Hari umugabo yitwa Yosefu, yari mu bagize inama nkuru y’abatwara ubwoko bw’Abayuda, akaba n’umuntu mwiza kandi agororotse. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Ntiyari ashigikiye abandi mu ngingo zose bafashe n’ivyo bakoze. Yava mu gisagara c’Abayuda citwa Arimataya, kandi yari yiteze ukuza kw’Ubwami bw’Imana. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nuko aja kwa Pilato, amusaba ikiziga ca Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Hanyuma akimanura ku musaraba, akizingira mu gitambara cera, aca agishira mu mva nshasha yimbwe mu gitandara, itari bwigere ihambwamwo n’umuntu n’umwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ivyo vyabaye ari ku musi wo kwitegurira Isabato, kandi yagira itangure.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Nuko ba bagore bavana na Yesu i Galilaya, bakurikira Yosefu, barabona ya mva, babona n’ukuntu ikiziga ca Yesu kiryamitsweyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Baca basubira i muhira bategura ibimota neza n’amavuta yo gusiga ikiziga. Ariko Isabato igeze bararuhuka kugira bubahirize icagezwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuzuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ku musi wa mbere utangura iyinga, hakiri kare mu gitondo, ba bagore bafata ibimota neza bari bateguye, baja ku mva. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bahashitse, basanga ikibuye cari cugaye imva catembagajwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />hanyuma barinjira, ariko ntibabona ikiziga c’Umwami Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Bakizazaniwe haca haboneka abagabo babiri bambaye impuzu zica ibibatsi, bahagarara i ruhande yabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ba bagore bagira ubwoba bwinshi, barunama, bakubita ibipfukamiro hasi; ariko ba bagabo barababwira bati: “Ni kuki muronderera umuntu muzima mu bapfuye? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ntari hano, yazutse. Nimwibuke ivyo yababwiye akiri kumwe namwe i Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />ati: <char style="wj">‘Umwana w’Umuntu azotabwa mu maboko y’abanyavyaha, bamubambe ku musaraba. Ariko ku musi ugira gatatu azozuka mu bapfuye.’</char> ” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Nuko baca baribuka amajambo yavuze.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bagarutse bavuye ku mva, bashika babarira bamwe cumi n’umwe n’abandi bose ivyabaye vyose. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Abo bagore bagiye kubwira intumwa ivyabaye bari Mariya Magadalena, Yowana, na Mariya nyina wa Yakobo, n’abandi bagore bari kumwe na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ariko intumwa ntizavyemera kuko ivyo abo bagore bavuga vyasa n’imigani kuri bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ariko Petero we arahaguruka agenda yiruka aja ku mva. Ashitseyo, arunama araba mu mva, abona vya bitambara vyera gusa, aca asubira inyuma yibaza ivyabaye.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka abantu bariko baja i Emawusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Kuri uwo musi nyene, abigishwa babiri ba Yesu bariko baja mu gisagara citwa Emawusi kiri nko kuri sitadiyo mirongo itandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 11.</char></note> uvuye i Yerusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />bagenda baganira ku vyabaye vyose. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Bakiriko baraganira bahanahana ivyiyumviro, Yesu aca arabegera ajana na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ariko amaso yabo anyegezwa uwo ari we, ntibamumenya.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ivyo mugenda muraganira ni ibiki?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Nuko baca barahagarara, bijiriwe cane. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Umwe muri bo yitwa Kirewofasi aca amubaza ati: “Ni wewe wenyene waje i Yerusalemu utamenye ivyahabereye muri iyi misi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Na we arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni ibiki vyabaye?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Baramwishura bati: “Ni ivya Yesu w’i Nazareti. Yari uwuvugishwa n’Imana, yuzuye ubushobozi mu vyo yavuga no mu vyo yakora, imbere y’Imana n’imbere y’abantu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abatware bacu baramutanze ngo acirwe urubanza rwo gupfa, maze baramubamba, <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />natwe twari twizeye ko ari we yocunguye Abisirayeli. Kandi uwu ni umusi ugira gatatu ivyo bibaye. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ikigeretseko, hari abagore bo muri twebwe badutangaje. Bagiye ku mva uno musi mu gitondo, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ariko ntibabona ikiziga ciwe. Baje batubwira ko abamarayika babiyeretse, bababwira ko ari muzima. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bamwe mu bagenzi bacu bagiye ku mva babisanga nk’uko abo bagore babivuze, ariko we ntibamubonye.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu aca ababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Yemwe bantu b’ubwenge buke mwe! Birabagora kwizera mu mitima yanyu ivyo abavugishwa n’Imana bavuze.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><char style="wj">Mbega Kristo ntiyategerezwa kubabazwa gutyo imbere y’uko yinjira mu bwiza bwiwe?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nuko ahera ku vyanditswe na Mose n’abavugishwa bose, abasigurira ico Ivyanditswe bimuvugako.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bagira bashike mu gisagara bari bagiyemwo, Yesu amera nk’uwushaka kubandanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ariko baramwinginga cane bati: “Gumana natwe kuko buriko burira, kandi umusi ugeze kure.” Nuko Yesu agumana na bo.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Bicaye bagira bafungure, Yesu afata umukate, awushimira Imana, arawumanyagura, arawubahereza. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Amaso yabo aca aruguruka, baramumenya, ariko aca arakamangana, ntibasubira kumubona. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Baca batangura kubazanya bati: “Mbega imitima yacu ntiyariko iragurugumba igihe yariko aravugana natwe mu nzira, adusigurira Ivyanditswe?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ubwo nyene baca barahaguruka basubira i Yerusalemu. Bashitseyo, basanga bamwe cumi n’umwe n’abari kumwe na bo bakoraniye hamwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />bariko bavuga bati: “Ni ukuri Umwami yazutse, kandi yiyeretse Simoni.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Maze abo bigishwa babiri na bo babiganira ivyabaye mu nzira bariko baragenda, n’ukuntu bamumenye amaze kumanyagura umukate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yiyereka intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Bakiriko barababwira ivyabaye, Yesu araza ahagarara hagati muri bo, arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Amahoro abane namwe!”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Baterwa n’ubwoba bwinshi kuko bibaza ko babonye umuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yesu arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Ni kuki mufise ubwoba no gukekeranya mu mitima yanyu?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" /><char style="wj">Ehe nimurabe ibiganza n’ibirenge vyanje. Ni jewe nyene. Nimunkoreko maze mumenye ko ntari umuzimu, kuko umuzimu utagira inyama n’amagufa nk’ivyo mumbonana.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, abereka ibiganza n’ibirenge vyiwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Bakizazaniwe kubera umunezero n’ugutangara kwinshi, arababaza ati: <char style="wj">“Nta vyokurya mufise?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Nuko bamuzanira ikimanyu c’ifi yokeje, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />na we aracakira, akirira imbere yabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Aca ababarira ati: <char style="wj">“Ibi ni vyo nari narababwiye nkiri kumwe namwe, ko ivyanditswe kuri jewe vyose mu Vyagezwe vya Mose, mu vyanditswe n’abavugishwa n’Imana no muri Zaburi, bitegerezwa gushika.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Aca abugurura ubwenge kugira ngo batahure Ivyanditswe. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Arababwira ati: <char style="wj">“Handitswe ngo ‘Kristo azobabazwa, apfe, hanyuma azuke mu bapfuye ku musi ugira gatatu,</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" /><char style="wj">kandi ubutumwa bw’ukwihana n’uguharirwa ivyaha buzovugwa mw’izina ryiwe mu mahanga yose, uhereye i Yerusalemu.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" /><char style="wj">Namwe muri ivyabona vyo gushingira intahe ivyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><char style="wj">Ehe ngiye kubarungikira ingabire Data yasezeranye, ariko mugume mu gisagara gushika muhawe ubushobozi buvuye mw’ijuru.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aduga mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Maze Yesu aca abajana inyuma y’igisagara, hafi y’i Betaniya, aramvura amaboko arabahezagira. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Akiriko arabahezagira, aca abavamwo, aduzwa mw’ijuru. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Baca barapfukama baramusenga, hanyuma basubira i Yerusalemu buzuye umunezero mwinshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Imisi yose bama mu rusengero, bahimbaza Imana.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>